Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.04,0:45:11.11,单行中文,,0,0,0,,很帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.39,1:09:10.82,单行中文,,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的 我叫惹泼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.18,1:09:13.44,单行中文,,0,0,0,,惹泼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.81,1:17:59.36,单行中文,,0,0,0,,保护法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect the staff.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.65,1:56:38.21,单行中文,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲就没有胜利
