Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.22,1:56:45.02,单行中文,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲就没有胜利
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.37,0:01:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你那位所谓的魔法师在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where in hell is your so-called magician?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他会来的 兰斯洛特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be here, Lancelot.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.39,0:01:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他发过誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He swore it.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.69,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备发起第二轮进攻了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're preparing for a second wave.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,冲锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.45,0:02:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这… 这看起来就像世界末日一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... This is what the end looks like.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你所谓的魔法师梅林帮不了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your so-called magician, Merlin, cannot help us.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.12,0:02:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们寡不敌众 要以一敌百{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're outnumbered, 100 to 1.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.93,0:02:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么才能杀出重围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna get out of this?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.00,0:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应给我一件强大的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He promised a weapon, one of great power.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.43,0:02:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑟 你是我的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, you are my king.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.05,0:02:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿为你献出我的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will lay down my life for you,
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.23,0:02:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个梅林不是巫师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this Merlin is no wizard.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.92,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个不值一提的醉鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a worthless drunkard!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我真的醉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I'm sozzledl
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.89,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last nip.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.32,0:03:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法确实存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic does exist.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在很久以前 它被发现于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was found, long ago,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.90,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一艘坠落的外星飞船里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside a crashed alien ship.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.99,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.63,0:03:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.67,0:03:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.16,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那个招魂者 黑魔法大师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}conjurer of spirits, master of the dark arts!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.76,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 梅林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I, Merlin.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那个巫师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wizard?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.76,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.81,0:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我帮你保密了 真的 我没有食言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I kept your secret! I did! Just as I promised!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.48,0:03:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我没和任何人提起你的存在 任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told no one of your existence. No one!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.45,0:03:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得理解 我们不列颠人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have to understand, we Britons
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.05,0:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,正在进行一场生死大战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are in a desperate fight.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.00,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是走投无路了 我是认真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End-of-times sort of thing. I mean it.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.20,0:04:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我们说话的这会儿 我的族人在浴血奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's happening down there now as we speak.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.77,0:04:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,相当糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's awful!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.04,0:04:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,刀光剑影的 杀的非常激烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big personalities just sort of clashing and bloody.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.22,0:04:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在难以启齿 但我们需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to ask... But we need your help.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没有咒语 也没有魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no spells. There is no magic.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们撤退 择日再战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We retreat. Live to fight another day.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.95,0:04:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲 哪来的胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without sacrifice... There can be no victory.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is madness!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他会来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will be here.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.85,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我就和他们说的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I am what they say!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.18,0:04:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个骗子 是个冒牌货 我这辈子都在坑蒙拐骗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a liar, I'm a charlatan. I've deceived my whole life.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.04,0:04:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我可以 哪怕只有一刻 改变世界 让它变得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I could, for one moment, change this world for the better,
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我会放弃其他一切 一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would give up everything. Everything!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.05,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我会戒酒 戒财 戒色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd give up drink, money, wom...
Dialogue: 2,0:04:46.24,0:04:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就戒酒和戒财{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink and money.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.57,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你的帮忙 很多好人都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good men will die without your help.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还有女人和孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women. Children.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.65,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的世界毁灭了 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your world was destroyed. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.18,0:05:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但请别让我们也重蹈覆辙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But please don't let ours die, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.81,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,算我求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg of you.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.66,0:05:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,守护骑士 变形 巨龙听候你的差遣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guardian Knights, transform. Dragon is yours to command.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是我想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be just the thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好这个法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect this staff.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.09,0:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,日后会有邪恶势力来夺取它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day a great evil will come for it.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.03,0:05:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.99,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,冲锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.44,0:06:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有句代代相传的话说道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been said through the ages,
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without sacrifice,
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.02,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哪来的胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there can be no victory.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙中有很多谜团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are mysteries to the universe
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.21,0:06:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远无法解开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were never meant to solve.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.88,0:06:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime
Dialogue: 2,0:06:47.44,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有句话要传给我的创造者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this message is to my creators:
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.84,0:06:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,离地球远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave planet Earth alone.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm coming
