Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.49,0:20:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定不开枪吗 我可是你们的目标呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you don't want to shoot? I'm a big Ol' target.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:00.85,0:20:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wusses.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.32,0:20:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底站哪一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:04.74,0:20:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all bad.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they're not.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:08.75,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰眼 标记他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagle Eye, tag him.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我从未见过像它这样的 将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen one like it, General.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个更古老 比擎天柱还老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's older, older than Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:21.34,0:20:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,路障也在同样的地点被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticon Barricade was spotted at that same location.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.59,0:20:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,CIA用捕食者监视他有一阵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CIA's had him under Pred surveillance for a while now.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.68,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直和一些有趣的对象有来往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's been keeping some interesting company.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.13,0:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,法杖被藏在地球上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The staff is hidden on Earth.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.26,0:20:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,充满终极力量的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weapon of ultimate power.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:48.13,0:20:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find this staff.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That voice.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.94,0:20:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就像噩梦里一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear it in my nightmares.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.75,0:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 威震天 - 有待确认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Megatron. - Waiting for authentication.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.64,0:20:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,威震天大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Megatron.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别照着我的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that out of my face.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,汇报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.14,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请告诉我你找到了护身符{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you have found the talisman.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:05.54,0:21:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了 一个濒死骑士交给了人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it. A dying knight gave it to a human.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.05,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但那里有太多变形金刚反应部队的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there was too much TRF firepower.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:11.54,0:21:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然让护身符被别人夺走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let the talisman get away!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须得到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have it!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:18.08,0:21:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有护身符 我们就无法找到法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without the talisman, we cannot find the staff!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.41,0:21:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道谁能带我们找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who can lead us to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,变形金刚反应部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The TRF.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.01,0:21:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,总司令命令那武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander in Chief wants that weapon,
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,或者叫它法杖 不论一切都要保护好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or "staff" as he calls it, secured at all cost.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,保留你在变形金刚反应部队的卧底身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maintain your covert embed with TRF.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.50,0:21:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 他们只是不懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir... They just don't get it.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们与大黄蜂还有变形金刚的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our history with Bee and the Autobots.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.56,0:21:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们多希望擎天柱能回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we would all give to have Prime back right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:46.56,0:21:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:49.05,0:21:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再次进入塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Re-entry Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.61,0:22:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My World!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:17.06,0:22:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has happened to my world?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的世界濒临死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your world is dying.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.55,0:22:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等你 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for you, Optimus.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.32,0:22:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来见见你的创造者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come meet your maker.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.16,0:22:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的创造者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my creator?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.56,0:22:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是昆塔莎 造物主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Quintessa, the Prime of Life.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.31,0:22:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我的家园做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to my home?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.66,0:22:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.98,0:22:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你胆敢袭击你的神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare to strike your god?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.53,0:22:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你的战争毁了塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your war doomed Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.31,0:23:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是威震天挑起的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Megatron started the war!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.51,0:23:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是你摧毁了你的世界 蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You destroyed your world, you fool.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:10.67,0:23:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我完美的造物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My perfect creation.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你去修正这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to fix it,
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.81,0:23:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,否则变形金刚会永远绝迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the race of Transformers dies forever.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我创造了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made you.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.72,0:23:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以要听我的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are mine to command.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.78,0:23:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么跑到这来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.53,0:23:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,主人 我们等了1600年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, that weird thing
Dialogue: 2,0:23:53.37,0:23:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,才发生的奇怪现象出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've been waiting for 1,600 years to happen...
Dialogue: 2,0:23:56.30,0:23:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这次是真的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's really happening this time!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.60,0:24:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The knight has arrived.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:09.87,0:24:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,护身符被赠与了正确之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The talisman has been bestowed.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:15.00,0:24:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,终于 长老 开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, Cogman. It begins.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:40.23,0:24:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.57,0:24:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:24:54.53,0:24:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:59.17,0:25:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,温布利 当时没人盯我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wembly! I was quite open.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:02.03,0:25:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没人盯你是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a reason why you're always open.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:03.94,0:25:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直单身也是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a reason you're always single.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:05.68,0:25:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:08.71,0:25:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:26.46,0:25:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.60,0:25:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,迟到了 迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So late, so late, so late.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:32.04,0:25:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,公元前484年 发生了一场文明与野蛮间的对决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}484 CE. A desperate last stand between civilization and barbarism.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:38.73,0:25:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,两个世界发生碰撞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two worlds colliding.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:40.29,0:25:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个世界能够幸存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one survives.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:42.46,0:25:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,兰斯洛特 珀西瓦尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lancelot. Percival.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:44.45,0:25:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑟王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Arthur.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:45.89,0:25:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,都是值得尊敬的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honorable men.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:47.46,0:25:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,英勇无畏 体格强健{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brave, muscles sinewed,
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.51,0:25:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大汗淋漓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sweat glistening off their bodies.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:52.97,0:25:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是仅有几位愿意为胜利献出一切的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few brave men who were willing to sacrifice all for victory.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:57.27,0:25:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,听着太不真实了吧 波比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound too good to be true, Poppy?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.73,0:26:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为都是扯淡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's horseshit.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:02.50,0:26:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑟王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.67,0:26:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是罗马将军与凯尔特人国王的结合体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A likely composite of a Roman general and a Celtic king.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.68,0:26:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dragon.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:10.15,0:26:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,只是只中世纪的投石机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a medieval catapult.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:12.17,0:26:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后梅林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we have Merlin,
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.90,0:26:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拥立国王者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our Kingmaker.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:16.39,0:26:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可能从未存在过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably never existed.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:19.33,0:26:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is,
Dialogue: 2,0:26:21.55,0:26:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么我们要给自己编这些故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why? Why do we tell ourselves these stories?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:25.01,0:26:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,除了广而告之龙是邪恶之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other than the fact that dragons are wicked.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:28.51,0:26:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那是我们希望相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because we want to believe.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.51,0:26:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这些英雄存在于我们的生活中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe that we can be heroes in our own lives.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:35.34,0:26:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当世界崩塌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When all seems lost,
Dialogue: 2,0:26:37.02,0:26:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,仅剩下我们几位勇敢的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few brave souls, us,
Dialogue: 2,0:26:39.28,0:26:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,能够拯救我们所知的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can save everything we've ever known.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:42.97,0:26:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说只有龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it just the dragons?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:59.28,0:26:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,
Dialogue: 2,0:27:01.33,0:27:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不用很久了 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it won't be much longer now, old friend.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:04.20,0:27:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日的迹象就在我们身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signs of the end are all around us.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:07.16,0:27:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做 是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do, don't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:11.39,0:27:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须重建家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must rebuild my home.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:15.05,0:27:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法拯救你的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a way to heal your world.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:19.09,0:27:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我创造力的源泉 法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My power of creation, the staff,
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.76,0:27:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,被我的12位守护骑士偷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was stolen from me by my 12 guardian knights.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:27.60,0:27:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们背叛了我 将它藏在了地球上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They betrayed me and hid it on Earth.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:31.44,0:27:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把它给了你珍视的人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gave it to your precious humans.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.65,0:27:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,法杖是唯一能让塞伯坦重获生机的途径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The staff is the only way to bring life back to Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.58,0:27:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮我去找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going to find it for me.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.07,0:27:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要得到救赎吗 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you seek redemption, Prime?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:47.25,0:27:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.93,0:27:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的造物主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My maker,
Dialogue: 2,0:27:51.28,0:27:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:54.77,0:27:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不要害怕 不要憎恨 也不要愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fear. No hate. No anger.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:00.81,0:28:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要害怕 不要憎恨 也不要愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fear. No hate. No anger.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.26,0:28:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我 你这个蛆虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off, You maggot!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:10.05,0:28:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 飞鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you, flying rat!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:14.96,0:28:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他还很小 很烦人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very little. Very tiring.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:17.75,0:28:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在这丧失理智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Losing our heads sitting around here.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:19.94,0:28:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,受够了隐藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tired of hiding.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:32.34,0:28:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,酋长 真是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Chief! Wow, nice...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:35.42,0:28:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.66,0:28:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真是匹好马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice horse you got there.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:38.25,0:28:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是对这些印第安东西着了迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really getting into this whole Indian thing, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:41.14,0:28:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我酋长 我叫谢尔曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't call me Chief. My name is Sherman.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:44.40,0:28:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是酋长吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you the tribal chief?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:45.89,0:28:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 但听起来似乎…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But from you it sounds...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:48.34,0:28:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 有点种族歧视啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, vaguely racist.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:51.25,0:28:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的巡逻车被偷了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My cruiser got stolen. - What?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:53.70,0:28:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第二次了 - 太惨了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Again. - That's terrible!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:55.86,0:28:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:56.80,0:28:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,事态控制不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit's getting out of control.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是犯罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's crime going on everywhere!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:59.60,0:29:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很多东西都被偷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bunch of my stuff got stolen.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:01.02,0:29:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别扯淡 凯德 把我车还我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the shit, Cade... And get me my car back.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:14.15,0:29:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是汽车人的网站吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this an Autobot hookup site?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:16.29,0:29:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是梦想去那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I just go here to dream.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:18.26,0:29:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那个漂亮的底盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out that classy chassis.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:20.83,0:29:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看这货箱里的垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the junk in her trunk.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:24.01,0:29:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,闪亮登场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Booyah! Big time.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.35,0:29:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该吃了蒂华纳街上所有的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should not have eaten all of that Tijuana street machinery.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:29.82,0:29:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 忘了还有个集束炸弹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, forgot about that cluster bomb.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:32.33,0:29:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.17,0:29:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem, dude?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:34.77,0:29:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小灵通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sqweeks!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:35.81,0:29:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,下回 剎车轻一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, ease on the brakes!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:38.45,0:29:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的风格 我喜欢隆重出场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way I roll. I like to make a statement when I arrive.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:42.29,0:29:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,营地都被你弄上灰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're getting dust all over the campus!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:44.21,0:29:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里才不是营地 是垃圾场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't no campus. It's a junkyard!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:45.79,0:29:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快来 快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, hustle.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.54,0:29:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:51.23,0:29:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别冲我发火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't take any aggression out on me.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:54.33,0:29:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 钢锁 我们是客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Grimlock! We're guests here!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:57.76,0:29:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你陷入麻烦了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got in some shit?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:59.30,0:30:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都快找上门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, neck deep!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 这就是你带大黄蜂出去的下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, that's what you get for taking the yellow bugger.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:04.44,0:30:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要找个领导 比如我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a leader out there... Like me.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.24,0:30:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 免得我给你带来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Before I do some damage
Dialogue: 2,0:30:09.67,0:30:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,无法恢复的伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't walk away from.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:10.79,0:30:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远成不了擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never be Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.81,0:30:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,话太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk too much.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:14.04,0:30:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 老兄 百万多岁的传奇战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. Million-year-old legendary warrior
Dialogue: 2,0:30:15.86,0:30:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们却表现的像一堆垃圾狗一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you act like a bunch of junkyard dogs!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.88,0:30:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你惹毛我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're starting to piss me off!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:25.82,0:30:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快回来 钢锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back here, Grimlock!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:27.64,0:30:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来 你嘴里有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around. What do you got in your mouth?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:32.42,0:30:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 保护你是浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, I am wasting my time protecting you.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:35.17,0:30:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放下巡逻车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the cruiser right now!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:37.11,0:30:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你吃了谢尔曼的巡逻车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you got Chief Sherman's cruiser.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.22,0:30:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才对 吐出来 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Serves you right. Spit it out! Spit it!
Dialogue: 2,0:30:55.01,0:30:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别吃车 别吃车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't eat cars. Don't eat cars.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:59.59,0:31:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,回到你的洞去 反省反省{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get back in your hole and think about what you did.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:01.93,0:31:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像是梅西百货感恩节的游行一样热闹啊 吉米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the Macy's Thanks giving Day Parade out here, Jimmy J.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:05.17,0:31:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你从达科他分账报的一则招人启示中雇佣了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hired me from a want ad in the Dakota Penny Ledger.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:09.48,0:31:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我有超能力吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think that comes with a superpower?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.85,0:31:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是恐龙 外星恐龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a dinosaur! An alien dinosaur!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:16.10,0:31:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,广告里可没说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was not in the ad!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.60,0:31:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天还想吃了我来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tried to eat me yesterday.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.16,0:31:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想进联邦监狱吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to go to federal prison?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:21.70,0:31:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不想进任何监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I don't want to go to any prison.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.56,0:31:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定要进监狱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's where you're gonna go, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:24.72,0:31:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是从犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're aiding and abetting.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:26.02,0:31:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是逃犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a fugitive, all right?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:26.85,0:31:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我是大老板 你只是我的小喽啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the big boss, you're my little crimey.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:28.48,0:31:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你走后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you leave,
Dialogue: 2,0:31:30.11,0:31:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这就变得跟动物世界一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it becomes the Wild Kingdom out here.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:32.29,0:31:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:33.28,0:31:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过这里是垃圾场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, this is a junkyard.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:34.56,0:31:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们和垃圾融为一体了 仅此而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They blend in with otherjunk. That's it.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:36.12,0:31:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你将我雇佣为国际公司的副总裁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hired me to be senior vice president of worldwide operations.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:39.29,0:31:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说过吗 - 你是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I tell you that? - Yes, that's what you said.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:41.12,0:31:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我瞎编的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made that shit up.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:42.17,0:31:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,请别把我的头衔拿走 凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not take this title away from me, Cade.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:44.10,0:31:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是创业公司 我干这个不是为了赚钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a startup, okay? I don't do this shit for money.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:46.42,0:31:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了更远大的事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for the higher cause.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:47.47,0:31:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是为了赚钱吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't do this shit for the money?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:48.72,0:31:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病 你吃什么啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you? How you gonna eat?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:50.32,0:31:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他来这做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:55.82,0:31:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,交易员来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daytrader's here.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:57.20,0:32:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,地球上最烦人的变形金刚来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes the most irritating, annoying Transformer on Earth.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:00.85,0:32:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他为了过那个门给了你什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he give you to get past the gate?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:02.41,0:32:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing!
