Dialogue: 2,0:34:01.22,0:34:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那太棒了 - 比别人都厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, good for you. - Better than anyone.
