Dialogue: 2,0:36:18.78,0:36:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 你要是饿了 我这里有冷冻披萨卷饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Look, if you're hungry, I got some frozen pizza burritos.
