Dialogue: 2,0:36:35.83,0:36:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 女汉子 突击测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, tough guy, I got a pop quiz for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:37.49,0:36:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,假设在Slant-6引擎上有个内联的能量晶体泄漏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say you got an inline Energon leak on a Slant-6.
