Dialogue: 2,0:36:53.17,0:36:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会烧结干路并把中央流改路至那个 那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd cauterize the artery and re-channel the central flow into the... The...
