Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.06,0:37:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它还在增长 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's growing. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.46,0:37:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,每天三米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three meters a day.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:42.34,0:37:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,六个角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six horns.
