Dialogue: 2,0:37:53.44,0:37:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,中国人叫他们 地狱之角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese call them "Horns from Hell".
