Dialogue: 2,0:38:13.93,0:38:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不 比那更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's much worse than that.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:16.32,0:38:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是由一个以现速为0.1倍光速的行星大小物体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a gravitational anomaly caused by a planet-sized object
