Dialogue: 2,0:38:49.24,0:38:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是在五磅重的袋子里 装上了10磅重的玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like somebody packed 10 pounds of shit in a five-pound sack.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:52.41,0:38:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 他是个大块头的汽车人 - 能不能别弄了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, he's a chunky Autobot. - You wanna stop that?
