Dialogue: 2,0:39:07.34,0:39:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哎呦 - 非得这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoops. - Really?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:08.44,0:39:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,小变形金刚太烦人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Infestation of puppy transformers.
