Dialogue: 2,0:39:15.67,0:39:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Dad?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:17.94,0:39:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你不能跟我讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know... I know you can't talk to me
Dialogue: 2,0:39:21.44,0:39:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,或是回答我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or say anything back.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:23.63,0:39:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但你可以听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can listen.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:27.96,0:39:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一直重复 直到你听我的话为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna say what I always say until you hear me.
