Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.08,0:42:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绝对不行 - 是啊 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Absolutely not. - Yeah. No.
