Dialogue: 2,0:58:54.01,0:58:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,否则来使斩了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the messenger will kill you.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:00.04,0:59:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕这些乱子都是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now then, I'm afraid all this ballyhoo is on your account.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:02.97,0:59:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想救你的朋友 你就离开他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to save your friends, you will leave them.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:06.17,0:59:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不要和那个矮精灵说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't talk to that leprechaun!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.37,0:59:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 然后就跟一个疯子忍者管家走吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, and run off with some crazy ninja butler?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:09.51,0:59:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不在的时候你的朋友会安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends will be safe in your absence.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:11.72,0:59:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你在的时候反而不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your presence, unsafe.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:14.28,0:59:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的重要性你自己都想象不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are more important than you can possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:18.76,0:59:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有人需要你 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are needed, sir.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:21.04,0:59:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,非常紧急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Urgently.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:22.76,0:59:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人很喜欢说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My master is fond of saying
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.16,0:59:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,生活中的所有重要的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that all the important decisions in life
Dialogue: 2,0:59:26.34,0:59:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,经常取决于一个瞬间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}often come down to just one moment.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:39.13,0:59:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的 你是我的家人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be all right. You're family now.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:42.27,0:59:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会照顾你的 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna take care of you, I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:44.46,0:59:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机在等着了 我们要去英格兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plane is waiting. We are going to England.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.10,0:59:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:49.46,0:59:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 阳光小姑娘 现在听我的指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up, Little Miss Sunshine, I'm in charge now.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:53.41,0:59:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不要指望我给你讲睡前故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't expect any bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:04.16,1:00:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到福尔杰号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Air Folgan.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:05.29,1:00:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请系好安全带 气流会致命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please strap in. Turbulence can kill.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:07.30,1:00:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,此次航班上不会提供零食 没有饮料 没有娱乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no snack service on this flight, no drinks, no fun.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:11.09,1:00:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,跟踪伊格尔 他在大西洋上方了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tracking Yeager. He's over the pond right now.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:14.04,1:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找了好久 不过卫星找到了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took some finding, but sats have him.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:16.04,1:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,威震天和他的人去英国了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Megatron and crew are bearing down on the UK.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:18.12,1:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格尔也是 这不可能是巧合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is Yeager. It's no coincidence.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:21.38,1:00:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上和你的队伍空降到英国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you airborne with your team to the UK ASAP.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:28.69,1:00:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,接电话 接电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up. Pick up.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:31.88,1:00:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:32.49,1:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别挂 - 又是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't hang up! - It's you again.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:34.08,1:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你了 你什么都给不了我 消失吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've told you, you have nothing to offer. Get lost.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:36.79,1:00:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我求你个事 福尔杰 我想自己做 但做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a favor, Folgers. I'd do it myself, but I can't.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:39.37,1:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐过古巴的飞机吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever fly a Cuban airplane?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:40.52,1:00:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是1940年代的飞机 飞行员也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're from the 1940s. So are the pilots.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:42.77,1:00:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,凯尔经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Book of Cyber-Kells.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:44.68,1:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被我找到了 - 那个古书 不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I found it. - The ancient book? Impossible.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:46.98,1:00:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你认识正确的清洁工就可能 我认识很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not when you know the right janitor. And I know many.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:49.05,1:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这本书是存在的 几个世纪没人见过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The book exists. Unseen for centuries.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.88,1:00:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,书页会在室温下分解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pages that literally dissolve at room temperature,
Dialogue: 2,1:00:54.60,1:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,材质是什么古老品种的羊宝还是什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made from some old kind of goat scrotum or something.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:57.89,1:01:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,三一图书馆 今天下午四点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity Library. Today, 4:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:00.81,1:01:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要知道这一切的结局就到那去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be there if you want to know how it all ends.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:09.08,1:01:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,物体确认为地外行星塞伯坦星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Object confirmed as exoplanet Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:13.98,1:01:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,距离撞击还有两天 七个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days, seven hours to impact.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:21.92,1:01:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 是时候让你知道真相了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, it is time you knew the truth.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:25.58,1:01:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个你称为地球的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place you call Earth
Dialogue: 2,1:01:27.86,1:01:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有另一个名字叫做 宇宙大帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has another name. Unicron.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:32.47,1:01:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,地球 宇宙大帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth... Unicron?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:36.34,1:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,塞伯坦古老的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cybertron's ancient enemy.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:39.76,1:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:41.18,1:01:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going to kill him.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:43.66,1:01:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,利用我的法杖 我们将抽干宇宙大帝的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my staff, we will drain the very life from Unicron.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:48.64,1:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地球会死去 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Earth will die... - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:51.56,1:01:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的世界会重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your world will be reborn,
Dialogue: 2,1:01:54.64,1:01:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nemesis Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:58.10,1:02:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我会击败所有挡路之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will fight anyone who stands in my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:04.85,1:02:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,外星角状物还在不断增大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The alien horns are still growing,
Dialogue: 2,1:02:06.95,1:02:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一些已经达到了400米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of them reaching 400 meters.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:09.31,1:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又是外星人的垃圾新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More alien rubbish.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:11.78,1:02:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,薇薇安 你找到男朋友没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you found a man yet, Viviane?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:14.01,1:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 太可惜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - So sad.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:15.43,1:02:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的应该好好找找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should really look in here.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:17.07,1:02:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 这有不少广告 有一部分很有吸引力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, there are lots of adverts, some of them very tempting.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:20.40,1:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个在找一个BBW 我不知道那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's looking for a BBW. I don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:22.88,1:02:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是种车 亲爱的 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a car, dear. - Right.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:24.44,1:02:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Beautiful Woman.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:25.87,1:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 谁知道呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it? Who knew?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:27.72,1:02:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看看分类信息栏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking at the classifieds!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:29.82,1:02:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有它自己的地牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's got its own dungeon.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:31.60,1:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我喜欢地牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! I love dungeons!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:34.12,1:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看见没 这太合适了 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's perfect for you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:35.68,1:02:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些老物件 你会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that old stuff, you'd love that.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:37.52,1:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,历史正在被改写 而你却想要谈论男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}History is being rewritten and you want to talk about a man.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:40.61,1:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,或者女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a woman.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:42.36,1:02:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,海伦阿姨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Helen.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:43.19,1:02:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,女追女 这不是嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Women Seeking Women." Here we go.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:46.09,1:02:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以问问我工作上的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could ask me about my work.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.05,1:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would we do that?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:49.42,1:02:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是些旧书罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's just dusty old books.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:51.60,1:02:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我有点盼望世界末日的到来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I welcome the end of days!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:53.07,1:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望你能找到像你父亲这样对的人 这有什么不好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so terrible about me wanting you to have what I had with your father?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:56.94,1:02:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个混球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was an ass.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:57.91,1:02:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道父亲没有什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what Father didn't have?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:59.66,1:03:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一样他挚爱的圆桌骑士都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one thing that his beloved Knights of the Round Table
Dialogue: 2,1:03:02.07,1:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而他却极其缺乏的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had in spades and he was utterly lacking?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:05.16,1:03:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,信用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honor.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:06.12,1:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这我无法反驳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can say that again.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:07.76,1:03:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是抱怨够了死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can stop loathing a dead man long enough,
Dialogue: 2,1:03:10.63,1:03:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你也许会想去他的书房看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might want to have a look in his study.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:12.42,1:03:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那堆垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that rubbish.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:13.52,1:03:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能想要留下几件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There might be something you want to keep.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:39.72,1:03:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not touch that!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:42.58,1:03:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Daddy.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:46.68,1:03:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不想要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:47.68,1:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,让学校都拿走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the university to take the lot.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:58.81,1:03:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔杰伯爵十二世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The 12th Earl of Folgan
Dialogue: 2,1:03:59.93,1:04:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,急切地邀请您于此刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"urgently requests your presence at High Tea
Dialogue: 2,1:04:02.51,1:04:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,前去喝下午茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"this very moment."
Dialogue: 2,1:04:12.28,1:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:20.80,1:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 让路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:23.66,1:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天吶 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God! Sorry!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:27.05,1:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:33.48,1:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 女士 别那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, mademoiselle, don't do that.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:35.10,1:04:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我是热破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Je m'appelle Hot Rod.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:36.94,1:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真要命 你也是他们中的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ alive, you're one of them!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:38.72,1:04:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到后面去 安静点 别再打我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back! Be quiet! Do not hit me again!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:49.37,1:04:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你是哪一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, which bloody bot are you, then?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:51.61,1:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,声波 震荡波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soundwave? Shockwave?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:53.44,1:04:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,至少告诉我 我是被个知名的变形金刚绑架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least tell me that I've been abducted by one of the famous ones.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:56.03,1:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我比他们所有人都要优秀得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so much better than all of them!
Dialogue: 2,1:04:58.65,1:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 我被绑架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! I'm being kidnapped!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:00.33,1:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 请坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mademoiselle, sit down!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:03.56,1:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Yes, yes, hello!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:05.86,1:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 兰博基尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Lamborghini!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:07.92,1:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you help?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:09.68,1:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我被绑架了 疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I've just been kidnap... Nuts!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:20.72,1:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this car!
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.09,1:05:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,多佛白崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Cliffs of Dover.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:50.84,1:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好女孩 乖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good girl. Good girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:58.20,1:06:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好姑娘 来 真乖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl. Come on. There's a good girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:19.94,1:06:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有客人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have guests!
Dialogue: 2,1:06:21.67,1:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是什么毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:23.18,1:06:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我的零件都掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! My bits are falling off.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:24.76,1:06:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot!
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.73,1:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello there!
Dialogue: 2,1:06:29.02,1:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:31.87,1:06:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好姑娘 - 主人 这家伙就是个楞头青{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good girl. - Master, he's a complete knucklehead.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:33.94,1:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对于刚才的事我感到很抱歉 你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm awfully sorry about that, but you see,
Dialogue: 2,1:06:37.00,1:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他以为现在还是1918或者1914年 大概就那段时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he thinks it's still the year 1918 or 1914. Something like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:41.56,1:06:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,太令人伤感了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So sad.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:42.43,1:06:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次世界大战什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World War I and all that stuff.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:44.91,1:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次马恩河战役 索姆河战役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... Battle of the Marne, Battle of the Somme,
Dialogue: 2,1:06:46.61,1:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,第二次马恩河战役 巴雪戴尔战役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle of the Marne, Battle of Passchendaele.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:48.80,1:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,壕沟与泥泞中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trenches and mud and death
Dialogue: 2,1:06:50.92,1:06:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是血迹和成堆的尸体 着实令人伤感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gore and all that. It's terribly sad.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:52.77,1:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,离蒂珀雷里还远 家乡遥遥无际{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It's a long way to Tipperary, it's a long way to go."
Dialogue: 2,1:06:55.48,1:06:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那真的是太残酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's... It's terrible!
Dialogue: 2,1:06:57.92,1:07:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,太惨烈了 你知道吗 但是当时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, so sad, you know? But then, I mean...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:00.74,1:07:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗 我是说 这种迟发性的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it? I mean, this late onset of, well...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:04.42,1:07:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人痴呆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robot dementia.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.26,1:07:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,得了之后可不好过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not at all pretty.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:09.81,1:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你那烟管里抽得是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're smoking in that pipe, man, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:12.11,1:07:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这里到底是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:13.79,1:07:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是把我拉到什么变形金刚的养老院了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you drag me to some Transformer retirement home?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:16.05,1:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 最好有人能给我解释一下 不然我可要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, somebody better start talking, or I'm outta here.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:18.53,1:07:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:20.21,1:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:21.33,1:07:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只在我小时候见过一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only met when I was a little boy in short pants.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:23.73,1:07:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概那么高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have been that tall.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:24.56,1:07:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可能高一点 可能矮一点 我不太记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe taller. Or maybe shorter, I can't remember.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.79,1:07:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但从不会忘记别人的长相 - 大黄蜂 你认识这家伙么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But never forget a face. - Bee, you know this guy?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:29.35,1:07:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don 't... with you.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:31.12,1:07:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:31.85,1:07:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来看看这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have a look at this thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:33.43,1:07:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗 这很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Very interesting.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:36.42,1:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:38.74,1:07:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你保守这个秘密这么长时间 知道那是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep a secret for so long, knowing it to be true,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:42.05,1:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 内心深处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet, deep down inside,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.18,1:07:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你却产生疑问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you begin to wonder,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:46.76,1:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生被荒废了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Has my life been wasted?"
Dialogue: 2,1:07:49.89,1:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有过那样的感觉 凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever felt like that, Mr. Cade?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.97,1:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我凯德就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just Cade.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:55.68,1:07:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 老前辈 我现在可没那么多耐心陪你猜谜语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, old timer, I don't have a ton of patience for riddles right now.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:58.91,1:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 但是你想要知道 不是吗 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but you want to know, don't you, "dude",
Dialogue: 2,1:08:02.50,1:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么不断来到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why they keep coming here.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:04.85,1:08:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来到地球 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Earth. Right?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:10.94,1:08:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很欣赏掐准时机的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do so love perfect timing.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:16.53,1:08:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,多靓的车啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a bitchin' car she is!
Dialogue: 2,1:08:27.16,1:08:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 别跑 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, little lady.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.21,1:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么非要这个样子呢 为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you have to be like that? Pourquoi?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:32.69,1:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是因为她被绑架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, is this a kidnapping sort of situation
Dialogue: 2,1:08:34.59,1:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还是因为 她第一次见变形金刚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or her first Transformer experience?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:36.88,1:08:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其实二者都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's both, really.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:38.74,1:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别再打我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not hit me again!
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.45,1:08:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她的战斗或逃跑反应很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she does have a rather nice fight-or-flight response.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:44.29,1:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她可真难搞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very difficult.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:48.48,1:08:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫埃德蒙·伯顿 福尔杰伯爵十二世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Edmond Burton, 12th Earl of Folgan.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:51.20,1:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,维特维坎家族团最后一名在世的成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last surviving member of the Order of the Witwiccans.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:56.76,1:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:04.69,1:09:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他非要倚在那吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he have to loom like that?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:11.06,1:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,热什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ut" What?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:13.46,1:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,热泼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ut rut"?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:15.49,1:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,热破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot Rod.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:17.45,1:09:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他有法国口音 - 他是法国人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's his French accent. - Is he French?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:19.81,1:09:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他只是喜欢那个口音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he just likes the accent.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:21.36,1:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我讨厌这口音 但是我摆脱不了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! I hate the accent! But I can't get rid of it.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:25.26,1:09:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我改不掉这个口音了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stuck with the accent.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:27.12,1:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他是位军人 薇薇安小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a soldier, Miss Viviane.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:28.37,1:09:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他向你的父亲宣誓要保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He swore an oath to your father to protect you.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:32.48,1:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸可真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some dad you got there.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:33.99,1:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那车真不错 要我说 你开着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a nice ride. I mean, you can roll right up
Dialogue: 2,1:09:35.62,1:09:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,去白金汉宫都不成问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Buckingham Palace in that thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:37.30,1:09:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你 美国佬 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you, American man, shut it.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.98,1:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这是做什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.45,1:09:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 为什么要把她请来 - 给你们介绍一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, why is she here? - Introductions.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:45.60,1:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是薇薇安·温布利小姐 牛津大学历史学硕士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Viviane Wembly. Master of History, Oxford.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:47.57,1:09:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哲学博士 也是在牛津大学读的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor of Philosophy, also Oxford.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:49.34,1:09:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,文学博士 还是牛津大学的学位 我想想 还有别的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Doctor of Letters, again Oxford, I think. Anything else?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:52.24,1:09:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样 认识一下凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, meet Cade.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.88,1:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeager.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:56.11,1:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德·伊格尔 我是个发明家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade Yeager. I'm an inventor.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:58.57,1:09:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个发明家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an inventor.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:59.65,1:10:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 我是 - 你都发明了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I am. - What have you invented?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:01.40,1:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很多东西 - 比如呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A lot of things. - Like?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:04.38,1:10:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比如很多东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a lot of things. Thing...
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.19,1:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听过的 - 像是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Things that you've heard of. - Like?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:08.21,1:10:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你将来会听说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, things that you will have heard of, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:09.65,1:10:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,专利还在申请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patents are pending.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:15.25,1:10:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别那个样子 啊是什么意思吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say that. What's "ah"?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:17.04,1:10:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道么 我也能来那一套 我是英国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I could do that, too. "I'm English,
Dialogue: 2,1:10:18.64,1:10:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我酷到喜不形于色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and I'm too cool for feelings."
Dialogue: 2,1:10:19.73,1:10:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 我来这是为了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, I've come here to be insulted
Dialogue: 2,1:10:21.14,1:10:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,被一个穿着脱衣舞娘裙子拿了一沓学历证书的象牙塔公主羞辱的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by some over-educated ivory-tower princess in a stripper dress?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:24.72,1:10:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,脱衣舞娘？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stripper?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:25.46,1:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也就只有在美国受过良好教育被视为一种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, only in America is a finer education an insult.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:28.85,1:10:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的裙子让你感到不适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if my dress makes you feel uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 2,1:10:30.65,1:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么也许我会把它脱下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then maybe I could take it off.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.02,1:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:34.70,1:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 你这个禽兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!
Dialogue: 2,1:10:36.45,1:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这人有什么毛病 - 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your problem? - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 2,1:10:39.75,1:10:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:41.38,1:10:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要我把他的头拧下来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I take his head off, madam?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:43.28,1:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很诱人的提议 但是 我能够维护自己的尊严{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tempting, but I can defend my own honor.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:46.90,1:10:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很想扭断他的脖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do so very much want to crush his windpipe.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:50.81,1:10:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,矜持一点 长老 你必须学着控制你的脾气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, Cogman. You must learn to control that impulse.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:54.08,1:10:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,把怒气转移到其它方面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Channel it into other things.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:56.86,1:10:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:58.48,1:11:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,像是铺床 做饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like making beds or cooking food.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:02.55,1:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抛光银器 我在努力了 伯爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Polishing the silver. I am trying, my lord.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:07.17,1:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个头领战士 很少见的种类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a "Headmaster". A very rare breed.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:10.17,1:11:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙疯了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That dude is disturbed, yeah?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.86,1:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,极度邪恶 人格分裂那种的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, seriously evil. Like, split personality.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:14.56,1:11:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:16.36,1:11:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,长老 17C玻璃杯在哪 你打碎了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman? Glass 17C is missing. Did you break it?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:20.22,1:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我给贵族当了700多年管家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been a butler for the aristocracy for 700 years.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:22.91,1:11:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没见过你这么难伺候的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the worst I've ever worked for!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:25.56,1:11:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是我前任的画像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These were all my predecessors.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.05,1:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是福尔杰家族的 这是我的姑奶奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all Folgans. And that was my aunt there.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:29.60,1:11:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的曾 曾 曾姑奶奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My great-great-great-great aunt.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:30.95,1:11:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,出于某些原因她把我的曾 曾叔祖父毒死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She poisoned my great-great-great uncle for some reason.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:33.28,1:11:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她疯得要命 是个彻头彻尾的疯婆子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was barking mad, she was an absolute bitch.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:35.27,1:11:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那边是我的祖父 阿洛伊修斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's my grandfather over there, Aloysius.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:37.29,1:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是阿诺德 我的第三个堂兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's Arnold, my third cousin.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:39.37,1:11:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他喝下水道的水 后来自杀了 他也疯得可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drunk sewage water, committed suicide. He was quite mad.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:41.86,1:11:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 他们都挺疯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were all mad, really.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:43.81,1:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面有弹孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's bullet holes.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:47.34,1:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 这是个坏脾气的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Nasty critter.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:49.29,1:11:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.40,1:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它杀了希特勒 别惹他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the watch that killed Hitler. Don't screw with it.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:55.50,1:11:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是维特维坎家族团的成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are all the Witwiccans.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.29,1:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们的鼎盛时期家族团相当成气候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our halcyon days we were quite the club.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:00.48,1:12:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,聚集了才华横溢的人 有探险家 科学家 艺术家 世界领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brilliant minds, explorers, scientists, artists, world leaders.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.67,1:12:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,文艺复兴的弄潮儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renaissance thrill seekers.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:04.98,1:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,像是俄国女皇叶卡捷琳娜二世 俄国女皇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People like Catherine the Great, Empress of all Russia,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:07.25,1:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Washington,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:07.96,1:12:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉·莎士比亚 英国女王伊丽莎白一世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Shakespeare, Queen Elizabeth of England,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:09.57,1:12:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕·林肯 弗雷德里克·道格拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abraham Lincoln, Frederick Douglass,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:10.83,1:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哈丽特·塔布曼 怀特兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harriet Tubman, the Wright Brothers,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.27,1:12:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,乔托 米开朗基罗 达尔文 丘吉尔 爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giotto, Michelangelo, Darwin, Churchill, Einstein,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:14.14,1:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,斯蒂芬·霍金 亨利五世 列昂纳多·达·芬奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stephen Hawking, Henry V, Leonardo da Vinci,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:16.55,1:12:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,牛顿 德·拉瓦锡 莫扎特 贝多芬 古斯塔夫·马勒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newton, de Lavoisier, Mozart, Beethoven, Mahler,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:19.03,1:12:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,埃德蒙·希拉里 泰迪·罗斯福 哥白尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edmund Hillary, Teddy Roosevelt, Copernicus,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.29,1:12:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,特斯拉 伽利略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tesla, Galileo.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:23.14,1:12:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都属于一个秘密的社团 如你所见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all belonged to a secret society, you see.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:25.36,1:12:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全都齐聚一堂只为一个事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All united in one cause.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:27.22,1:12:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,保守变形金刚在地球上历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To protect the secret history of Transformers.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.93,1:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. On Earth.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.91,1:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一副维特维坎谱系图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is {}the Witwiccan family tree.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:36.56,1:12:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,梅林 薇薇安娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merlin, Viviana.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:38.60,1:12:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可以向上追溯40代人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goes back 40 generations.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:41.25,1:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,到那边的桌子去 那里有张照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go over to that desk. There's a photograph there.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:43.86,1:12:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲也曾是成员之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was a member.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:46.57,1:12:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他非常希望告诉你这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He very much wanted to tell you that.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:50.90,1:12:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己的家族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my own family had some...
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.68,1:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也对此有所贡献{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small part in all this.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:58.77,1:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,ZB-7{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ZB-7.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:00.34,1:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很像大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That looks just like Bee.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:01.83,1:13:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,的确如此 他跟随第一特遣部队作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is. He was attached to the Devil's Brigade.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:04.44,1:13:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常强大的军事单位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty vicious military unit.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:06.73,1:13:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助扭转了战局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helped turn the tide of war, you know?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:20.18,1:13:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并非受邀而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not invited.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:49.97,1:13:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大黄蜂还干过这些 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bee? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:51.22,1:13:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但他那么和善{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's so nice.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:52.45,1:13:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,战争期间 在后方 人们对他有很多评价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind the lines, during the war, they called him many things.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:55.53,1:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,和善绝不是其中之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Nice" was never one of them.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:57.96,1:14:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都起始于公元484年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all began in 484 AD,
Dialogue: 2,1:14:00.21,1:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑟王和他的巫师 梅林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when King Arthur and his wizard, Merlin,
Dialogue: 2,1:14:03.52,1:14:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在巴登山大败萨克森部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stared down and vanquished the Saxon hordes at Mount Badon.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:06.59,1:14:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他的剑和他的法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his sword and his mace there.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:09.94,1:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a myth.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:11.46,1:14:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 每个传说 神话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, every legend, every myth,
Dialogue: 2,1:14:12.77,1:14:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,每个篝火边口耳相传的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every story whispered around the campfire
Dialogue: 2,1:14:15.11,1:14:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都有一个合理的解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a logical explanation.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:17.09,1:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这我完全同意 但已经毫无逻辑可言了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With that I agree wholeheartedly, but logic has left the building.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:20.13,1:14:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你在讲魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about magic.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:21.81,1:14:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你说会走路说话的兰博基尼是魔法吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, like your walking, talking Lamborghini?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:24.18,1:14:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,任何足够超前的技术都与魔法无异{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Any sufficiently advanced technology is indistinguishable from magic."
Dialogue: 2,1:14:27.68,1:14:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑟·C·克拉克 厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur C. Clarke. Impressive.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:29.60,1:14:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对 还包括那些没有学生贷款{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. And count 'em, zero student loans,
Dialogue: 2,1:14:31.80,1:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,博士 教授 哲人 不管你叫自己什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, or Professor, Philosopher, whatever you call yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:35.14,1:14:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是我的头衔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all of the above.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:42.57,1:14:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this place was built
Dialogue: 2,1:14:44.77,1:14:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是建立在原始圆桌的基础上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around the original Round Table.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:47.38,1:14:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,珀西瓦尔 高文 崔斯坦 兰斯洛特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Percival, Gawain, Tristan, Lancelot.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:54.73,1:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就坐在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sat right here.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:59.19,1:15:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,十二人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve in all.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:01.12,1:15:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们之后坐着十二位塞伯坦人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And behind them sat the 12 who came from Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:11.01,1:15:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为荣誉而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fight for honor.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:13.81,1:15:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为人类而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fight for the human race.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:16.21,1:15:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,为人类的美好而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For all that is good in mankind.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:18.74,1:15:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,敬新朋旧友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To brothers old and brothers new!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:22.02,1:15:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,敬新朋旧友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To brothers old and brothers new!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:33.41,1:15:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲就没有胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sacrifice, no victory!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:36.89,1:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在卡米洛特的十二位外星骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve alien knights who saw in Camelot
Dialogue: 2,1:15:40.26,1:15:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,展现了人类能达到的最好的境界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what the human race could be at its finest.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:43.47,1:15:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,荣誉的竞赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A race of honor.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:54.99,1:15:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:56.49,1:15:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你又破坏气氛了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ruined the moment again!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:58.29,1:16:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想让气氛更恢弘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was making the moment more epic.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:01.18,1:16:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be quiet.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:02.67,1:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:04.18,1:16:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让我找到他脖子我一定掐死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could find his neck, I'd strangle him.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:06.90,1:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是阿瑟王的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This belonged to King Arthur himself.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:10.24,1:16:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,传说最后的骑士在某天会注定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, legend held that one last knight would someday be chosen
Dialogue: 2,1:16:14.20,1:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,接受使命为拯救世界顽强而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the struggle to save the world would begin.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:17.19,1:16:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来 凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would appear, Mr. Cade,
Dialogue: 2,1:16:20.08,1:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最后的骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that that last knight is you.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:25.49,1:16:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:26.64,1:16:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是他穿越了整个宇宙就为了找我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying he traveled the whole universe to find me?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:28.70,1:16:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是特意来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not you specifically.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:29.84,1:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不是来找这个德州来的失败发明家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a failed inventor from the state of Texas.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:32.22,1:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, God forbid.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:34.81,1:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:37.19,1:16:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.75,1:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是不停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you don't stop it,
Dialogue: 2,1:16:39.60,1:16:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我会用一个小盒子装你送回塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will send you back to Cybertron in a little tiny box.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:42.75,1:16:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我好怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scary.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.49,1:16:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是失败的发明家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a failed inventor.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:45.40,1:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他要找的是符合骑士精神的人 凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he meant the qualities of a knight, Mr. Cade.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:49.37,1:16:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,薇薇安小姐 骑士精神 请说一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Viviane, the qualities of a knight, if you please?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:52.13,1:16:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士精神是 纯净的心灵 勇猛 荣誉感 贞洁 正直{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qualities of a knight, purity of heart, valor, honor, virtue, integrity.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:56.34,1:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我有这些品质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have those.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:57.14,1:16:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,最重要的是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And most importantly...
Dialogue: 2,1:16:58.42,1:17:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是否纯贞 - 被人追吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he chaste? - Chased?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:00.62,1:17:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 我被你那奇怪的伙计一直追{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, I was getting chased when your little weirdo buddy
Dialogue: 2,1:17:02.28,1:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,直到把我带到这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}brought me over here on the plane.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:04.35,1:17:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,纯贞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Chaste".
Dialogue: 2,1:17:05.53,1:17:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,纯 贞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C-H-A-S-T-E.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:07.22,1:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,贞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"T".
Dialogue: 2,1:17:08.09,1:17:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,禁欲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Celibate?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:08.74,1:17:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是逗你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know... I was making a joke.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:10.73,1:17:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I know how to spell?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:12.05,1:17:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道他的意思 - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know what he meant. - Sure you were.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:13.73,1:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No whoopee, Mr. Cade?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:16.98,1:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很久没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:18.59,1:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很久是多久 一周 一个月 一年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how long's "a while"? A week? A month? A year?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:21.52,1:17:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不关你事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of your business.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:22.86,1:17:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得问你这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we need to ask you the question.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:25.60,1:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很久就是很久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A while!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.71,1:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:29.36,1:17:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这又是英国人的毛病吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that, like, another English thing?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:30.74,1:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是我们好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Just a curious thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:33.12,1:17:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我守身如玉呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe I'm saving myself.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:34.51,1:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要守身如玉 老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saving yourself for, old age?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:36.47,1:17:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个英国女人 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, English lady, shut it.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:40.40,1:17:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么 地图吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Some sort of a map?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:43.06,1:17:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这桌子来自塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This table is from Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:44.58,1:17:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我研究了一阵子的地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a puzzle I've been working on for some time.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:47.97,1:17:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,其实研究一生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My entire life, actually.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:49.74,1:17:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这些字符是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do these glyphs say about it?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:51.94,1:17:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,古塞伯坦语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're Olde Cybertronian.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:53.94,1:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,从宇宙低声传来的咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mantra whispered through the cosmos.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:00.04,1:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:01.76,1:18:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我听过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard that before.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:04.47,1:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,船上的骑士说过 是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A knight on a ship. What does it mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:07.33,1:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,用你最后一口气 保护好法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"With your dying breath, protect the staff."
Dialogue: 2,1:18:11.19,1:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这太荒唐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:19.10,1:18:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为它起了名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had their name for it.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:21.22,1:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have ours.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:23.03,1:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,梅林之杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The staff of Merlin.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:24.59,1:18:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,外星人赠与他的 融合了他的基因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bequeathed to him by an alien race. Fused with his DNA.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:28.93,1:18:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因此只有他才有打开它里面外星力量的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that only he would have the key to unlock its alien power.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:34.00,1:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是如今的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or as they knew it in those days,
Dialogue: 2,1:18:36.88,1:18:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}magic.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:40.15,1:18:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这支法杖葬在了梅林身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The staff was buried with Merlin's body.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:44.00,1:18:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们藏了一千年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand years we've kept it hidden.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:46.64,1:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,若是落入坏人手中 意味着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it ever fell into the wrong hands, it would mean
Dialogue: 2,1:18:49.38,1:18:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所热爱的一切便会毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the imminent destruction of everything we know and love.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:53.94,1:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,12位守护骑士合体变成了龙来保护它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 12 Guardian Knights combined into a mighty dragon to protect it.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.24,1:18:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它陷入了大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it is in great danger.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:00.38,1:19:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,威震天 他在找它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Megatron. He was after this.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:03.22,1:19:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以大战要来临了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the battle is upon us.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:04.78,1:19:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他们在这的原因 为什么他们一直来地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is why they're here, why they keep coming to Earth.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:06.51,1:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须在太迟之前拿走法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we must claim the staff before it is too late.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:09.42,1:19:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. We what?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:10.93,1:19:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一位梅林的直系后代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a direct descendant of Merlin himself
Dialogue: 2,1:19:14.42,1:19:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,能够挥动这拥有绝对权力的法器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can wield this instrument of absolute power.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:17.97,1:19:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而你 薇薇安小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Miss Viviane,
Dialogue: 2,1:19:20.70,1:19:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是梅林在地球上最后一位后裔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are Merlin's last descendant here on Earth, and as such,
Dialogue: 2,1:19:23.38,1:19:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 你是我们最后的希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are our last hope.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:25.97,1:19:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 往回一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wait. Go back.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:27.44,1:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我和魔法师梅林有血缘关系吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying that I'm related to the wizard Merlin?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:36.29,1:19:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有点惊讶 是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bit of a shock, isn't it?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:38.53,1:19:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你知道法杖在哪 由你父亲传给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you know the staff's location, imparted to you by your father.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:43.04,1:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定会留下线索 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had to leave a clue, didn't he?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:45.88,1:19:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:47.04,1:19:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看她这样似乎不知道法杖在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't have that "I know where the staff is" look.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:49.07,1:19:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我父亲唯一告诉我的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the only thing that my father imparted to me
Dialogue: 2,1:19:51.89,1:19:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,离开他的书房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was to get out of his study.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:53.46,1:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"两个世界碰撞 只有一个存活"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Two worlds colliding, only one survives."
Dialogue: 2,1:19:56.12,1:19:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的原话 只是你下课了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your words exactly. Only lecture time is over.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:59.62,1:20:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是为此而生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were born for this.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:02.37,1:20:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们来这之前自己星球的最后画面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the latest image of their world coming here.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:05.17,1:20:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们都挡了他们的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're all that stand in its way.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.09,1:20:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你们必须快点找到法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you'd better find that staff quickly.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:09.50,1:20:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:10.99,1:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,变形金刚反应部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TRF.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.84,1:20:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,包围封锁城堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surround the castle and lock it down.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:16.96,1:20:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,军情六处和变形金刚反应部队来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MI6 and TRF are here!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:19.53,1:20:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Go!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:21.40,1:20:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,长老 带我去伦敦好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman, get me to London, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:27.05,1:20:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伪装车准备好了吗 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The decoy car is ready? - Hurry along.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:31.65,1:20:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got 'em, boys!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:37.32,1:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, move! Quick, quick, quick!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:40.87,1:20:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 带我们离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get us out of here, Bee.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:42.96,1:20:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开 我的武器能停止时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here! My weapon will stop the time!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:59.71,1:21:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦估计都会被逗乐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein would've been tickled pink. Foo-Foo!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:05.41,1:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 这边 这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, this way, this way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:07.98,1:21:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,霰弹枪 我要霰弹枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shotgun. I call shotgun.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:18.74,1:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机入境 可以安全降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inbound helos, you are clear to land.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:21.95,1:21:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,伦诺克斯上校刚到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Lennox just hit the deck.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.69,1:21:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是桑托斯 美国分部队长 有什么消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Santos, Team Leader USA. What you got?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:31.57,1:21:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,变形金刚反应部队飞艇上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TRF airship on the way.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:41.06,1:21:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在后面等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me around back, Bee.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:44.48,1:21:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suck at this game!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.11,1:21:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你咬手指的时候就出卖了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you bite your nails, you give everything away.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:48.37,1:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:50.61,1:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, this is Cade.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:53.08,1:21:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 这是我家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, this is my family.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:55.36,1:21:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:56.85,1:21:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Cade?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:58.07,1:22:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我叫玛丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. I'm Marie.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:00.00,1:22:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你有地牢吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a dungeon?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:01.05,1:22:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 手像个粗糙的老树皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my goodness! Hands like rough old maple.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:03.38,1:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看着像木头一样强壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks hard as wood.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:04.76,1:22:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰他 我去换衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch him. I'm gonna go and get changed.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:07.49,1:22:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到一通三一图书馆的愤怒清洁工来的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a call from a very irate janitor at Trinity Library.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:11.45,1:22:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:12.57,1:22:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 如他们所说 陷入了小麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are, as they say, in a bit of a pickle.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:14.37,1:22:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在别搞我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not mess with me at this moment!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:15.84,1:22:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,天气很热 我脾气也很爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hot, and I am on a short fuse.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:22.00,1:22:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 去图书馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Get to the library!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.38,1:22:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这场追逐真是让我紧张极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This chasing is stressing me out.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:28.82,1:22:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,军情六处和变形金刚反应部队要找到我们了 我们得快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MI6 and TRF are gonna find us. We got to hurry.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.68,1:22:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲东西很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad had a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:34.89,1:22:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那找到法杖的地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, finding the staff's location...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.53,1:22:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么意思 我们在找 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean? We're looking for, like, what?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:37.84,1:22:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,地图 或者信件 书 或者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, a map, or a letter, or books, or...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:40.02,1:22:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 在这里找得找一年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit! It'll take a year to find something in here.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:43.08,1:22:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道上哪找那该死的法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where to find this bloody staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:45.55,1:22:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个小假马 没准塞在它屁股里之类的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this little fake horse. Probably stuffed in its butt or something.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:48.24,1:22:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就爱干蠢事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys do stupid stuff like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:51.50,1:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上面发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on up there?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:54.35,1:22:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你查照片后面了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You checking behind pictures?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.81,1:22:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,撕了吧 使劲撕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just rip it. Rip it apart!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:57.91,1:22:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着 快点 我们快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just grab it. Hurry, let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:59.60,1:23:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真刺激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exciting.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:00.69,1:23:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我拿不出来 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't get it out. - Great.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:03.80,1:23:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天 攒了这么多东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Such a hoarder.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:09.31,1:23:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像里面进了人猿泰山一样闹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like having Tarzan in the house.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:11.44,1:23:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:13.83,1:23:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去看一眼 - 别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna take a peek. - No!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:16.34,1:23:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 接电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Answer me, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:21.03,1:23:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 告诉我在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, tell me where it is!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:22.63,1:23:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,想得美 先让我加入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast. I want in.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:26.67,1:23:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,当维特维坎人 必须与众不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be a Witwiccan, you have to be a special person.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:28.99,1:23:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而你 并不具备资格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, sir, are not.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:30.19,1:23:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让我进去我就告诉你 现在马上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read me into the club and I'll tell you. Right here, now.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:33.12,1:23:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,电话里吗 这太野蛮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the phone? That is absolutely barbaric.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:36.11,1:23:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就在电话里 快点 英国佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the phone. Do it, Englishman!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:38.21,1:23:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,作为第12位福尔杰伯爵 以神圣的阿瑟王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the 12th Earl of Folgan, by the power imbued
Dialogue: 2,1:23:40.93,1:23:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,灌输的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by His Majesty King Arthur
Dialogue: 2,1:23:42.83,1:23:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以及他的圆桌骑士联盟为名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his League of Knights of the Round Table,
Dialogue: 2,1:23:44.71,1:23:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我授予你 西莫·卢瑟福·西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now grant you, Seymour Rutherford Simmons...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:47.02,1:23:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进入 - 接受 不是进入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Entrance into... - "Admittance", not "entrance"!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:49.62,1:23:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别唬我 说正确的词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to snooker me. Get it right.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:50.92,1:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 够了 快点告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough, enough, enough. Just tell me! Now!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:54.77,1:23:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你自己安静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! "Shh" yourselves.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:58.20,1:23:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有什么毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you all?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:59.93,1:24:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,六号书架 C排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stack six, row C.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:01.26,1:24:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 书页正在融化 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, man, they're dissolving scrotums. Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:03.22,1:24:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我正赶过去呢 听你讲话真容易犯迷糊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going! I'm going! It's very confusing talking to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:05.70,1:24:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快点 老头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, old man, get there!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:06.82,1:24:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 西蒙斯 你说了今天不用工作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Simmons, you said no work today.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:08.41,1:24:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起去沙滩给你那双大白腿晒晒黑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get your pale-ass legs and go to the beach.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:10.93,1:24:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我有正事 我保证只要五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working here, all right? Five minutes, I swear!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:13.55,1:24:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是说五分钟 也就是不的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always say five minutes. That means no.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:15.95,1:24:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找罗德里戈和胡里奥开始准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go get Rodrigo and Julio and get the game started.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:18.61,1:24:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌罗德里戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate Rodrigo.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:20.06,1:24:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还有十分钟我就去找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll set and bump with you in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:21.48,1:24:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 我还没忙完呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, come on, I'm in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:23.14,1:24:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, back.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:24.08,1:24:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,早在中世纪 这些魔法师就清楚 末日会何时降临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They knew way back in the Dark Ages where the end would begin.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:28.08,1:24:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,塞伯坦与地球共同存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is Cybertron and there is Earth.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:30.19,1:24:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只是他们从来不叫这里"地球"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only they don't call it Earth at all, they never did.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:31.88,1:24:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用另一个名字来称呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called it something else.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:33.13,1:24:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一个会被另一个吸干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One will suck the other dry,
Dialogue: 2,1:24:34.96,1:24:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,像巨大的吸管一样 直到只剩一方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a giant succubus, until only one remains.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:41.21,1:24:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,地球是宇宙之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth is Unicron.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:42.89,1:24:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,某天他会扬起角去对抗疯女昆塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day his horns will rise to fight the mad goddess Quintessa.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:47.73,1:24:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她会牺牲我们的星球 让自己的星球复活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She will end our planet to resurrect her own.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:51.76,1:24:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Hurry!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:52.67,1:24:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 长老 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My lord. - Cogman, go!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:54.24,1:24:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我在哪 - 我刚给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me where it goes down. - I just Dropped it to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:56.86,1:24:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,角是找到法杖地点的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The horns are the key to the location.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:59.28,1:25:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么他们胡乱地散落在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they spread out all over the Earth
Dialogue: 2,1:25:00.77,1:25:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,地球 答案是 并没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a jumble? The answer, they aren't.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.21,1:25:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,失控与大自然让他们分裂开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time and Mother Nature pulled them apart.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:04.50,1:25:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是盘古大陆 超大陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Pangaea. The supercontinent.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:06.28,1:25:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,和圆桌的形状一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same shape on the Round Table.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:08.01,1:25:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,福尔杰 看一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a gander, Folgers,
Dialogue: 2,1:25:09.37,1:25:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在那完美的圆形中心有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at what's smack in the center of that perfect circle.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:12.55,1:25:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 聪明 - 那是巨石阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Genius! - That's Stonehenge!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:14.82,1:25:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,史上最伟大的谜团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the greatest mysteries of the ages.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:16.55,1:25:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在都没人知道它的作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one understood its purpose until now.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:18.56,1:25:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 除了我 没人 - 那就是开始的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one. Except me. - That's where it all begins.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:21.36,1:25:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是大佬 快采取措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the man behind the man. Do something.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:23.32,1:25:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我 西蒙斯兄弟 别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll handle it, Brother Simmons, fear not.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:25.38,1:25:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没有兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had a brother.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:28.40,1:25:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels nice.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:29.70,1:25:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,去沙滩咯 准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beach time! Ready?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:36.36,1:25:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"薇薇安跟着梅林"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Viviane followed Merlin."
Dialogue: 2,1:25:39.16,1:25:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:40.82,1:25:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的秘密储藏间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My secret cupboard!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:47.02,1:25:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:48.78,1:25:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"薇薇安跟着梅林"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Viviane followed Merlin."
Dialogue: 2,1:25:50.21,1:25:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只有梅林才能挥动魔法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only Merlin could wield the magic staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:54.20,1:25:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,梅林和小女孩 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merlin and little girls, of course.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:00.83,1:26:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,海军博物馆 法杖肯定在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Navy Museum, that's got to be where the staff is.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:03.01,1:26:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天 原来一直都在我手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in my hands all along.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:08.86,1:26:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A队 快去 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha team, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:11.07,1:26:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 英国变形金刚反应部队 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- British TRF! - Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:14.96,1:26:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I surrender.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:17.09,1:26:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,主人 变形金刚应对小组正在紧追不舍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, TRF is on our tail.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:19.85,1:26:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么非把诱饵车停得那么远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you park the decoy car so far away?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:21.99,1:26:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a fusspotl
Dialogue: 2,1:26:24.54,1:26:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 别让咱俩被抓了 长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Don't let us get caught, Cogman.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:27.86,1:26:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我就擅长这个 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My speciality, my lord.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:47.73,1:26:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 你也不是非得杀人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! You don't have to kill people.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:56.14,1:26:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:00.51,1:27:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这倒提醒我了 艾格尼丝打了个电话过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which reminds me, Agnes called.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:02.60,1:27:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她想知道你今晚有没有空跟她共度良辰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wondered if you're available for a bit of a snuggle this evening.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:06.02,1:27:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是很愿意 但你看我像有空的样子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love a snuggle with Agnes. Do I look available?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:18.95,1:27:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闪开 混蛋 别挡路 - 自杀式撞击来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move, bitch! Get out of my way! - Kamikaze pilot!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:20.71,1:27:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 混蛋 别挡我的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, bitch! Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:24.06,1:27:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 是我 - 海军博物馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. Yes. - Navy Museum.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:27.78,1:27:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,皇家海军博物馆 我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Royal Navy Museum. I knew it!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:34.91,1:27:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 我来吸引警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, I'm gonna divert the cops!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.87,1:27:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一个霸天虎已经被{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Decepticon has been seen...
Dialogue: 2,1:27:41.09,1:27:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你说霸天虎是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, Decepticon?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.32,1:27:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刺激的来了 - 还搞刺激的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's where it gets intense. - More intense?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:58.73,1:27:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:06.50,1:28:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 他们把我们包围了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn, they're all around us
Dialogue: 2,1:28:07.81,1:28:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的路怒症又要犯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I just have so much road rage!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:10.18,1:28:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,释放怒火吧 就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actualize the rage. That's it!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:13.62,1:28:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想尝尝嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:17.80,1:28:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,长老 炸了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman, blast them!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:31.79,1:28:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:35.36,1:28:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个死胡同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a one-way street!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:37.16,1:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,车又不是我开的 是他开的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not driving. He's driving.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:41.14,1:28:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 2,1:28:47.14,1:28:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大黄蜂 往右边 有个跟屁虫 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bee, head right, haul ass! - Go!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:03.93,1:29:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这样你才能进大联盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you get to the big leagues.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:08.99,1:29:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hurt.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:10.48,1:29:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? You are out of your mind!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:18.31,1:29:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们甩掉他们了吗 - 嘿 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did we lose them? - Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:19.38,1:29:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们没买票 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't pay! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:20.61,1:29:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 有我呢 他们只不过特喜欢潜艇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, I've got them! They just love submarines.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:25.91,1:29:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可有点粗鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a bit rude.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:26.82,1:29:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是啊 这就是新一代的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they are, aren't they? That's the modern generation.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:29.28,1:29:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这个博物馆要永久关门了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this museum is closed for eternity.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:32.58,1:29:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 都给我出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you boys and girls, off the sub now!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:34.86,1:29:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧出去 快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off the sub now! Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:37.64,1:29:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 死肥仔快走 快给我挤出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, push! Move your fat ass! Push! Squeeze!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:40.19,1:29:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:42.16,1:29:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西发动不起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing isn't gonna run.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:43.87,1:29:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,任务是在未经探索的深水之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission's in deep, unexplored waters.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:48.53,1:29:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真是棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:49.89,1:29:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有一股男人们挤在一起的汗味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the sour-sweet musk of men in close quarters.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:52.77,1:29:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,其实有点恶心 真心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite disgusting, really.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:55.09,1:29:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now this,
Dialogue: 2,1:29:56.46,1:29:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,史上最伟大的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the greatest mission of them all,
Dialogue: 2,1:29:58.39,1:30:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一辈子所渴求的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one that I have longed for my entire life...
Dialogue: 2,1:30:01.44,1:30:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它能改变人类的历史 知道么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help turn the tide of human history, you know?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:08.77,1:30:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, alas,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:11.81,1:30:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不能和你们一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can no longer join you.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:14.69,1:30:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是大人 您等这一刻已经等了71年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, my lord, you have been waiting for this moment for 71 years.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:17.72,1:30:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但我恐怕不是当骑士的料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know, but I'm not knighthood material, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:21.45,1:30:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而且{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...
Dialogue: 2,1:30:23.00,1:30:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有你们的任务 我也有我的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have your mission, and I have mine.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:24.53,1:30:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 你不可以把我们和那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no. You are not leaving us in this tin can
Dialogue: 2,1:30:27.28,1:30:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,四脚神经病一起丢在这个铁罐子里 这可不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with that four-foot mental psychopath. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:29.46,1:30:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢反社会分子这个称呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer the word "sociopath".
Dialogue: 2,1:30:31.78,1:30:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德先生 你一生所做的所有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cade, everything you've done in your life,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:33.85,1:30:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的痛苦与折磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your pain and your suffering,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:35.86,1:30:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,丧妻之痛 被迫和女儿分开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the loss of your wife, separation from your daughter,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:38.32,1:30:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再加经济情况窘迫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your financial difficulties,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:39.82,1:30:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这一路来风雨不断 只为了此刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all just been a journey to this very moment.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:46.73,1:30:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你话真多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk a lot.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:49.38,1:30:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I suppose I do.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:52.94,1:30:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:54.94,1:30:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸把联盟号交给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your father left the Alliance to you,
Dialogue: 2,1:30:57.82,1:30:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,并且只交给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you alone.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:59.17,1:31:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows the way to the staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:01.25,1:31:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck to both of you.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:04.37,1:31:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定不是我今天干过的最奇怪的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be the strangest thing I've done today.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:10.43,1:31:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,希望她还会开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope the old girl's still got it.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:19.48,1:31:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck!
Dialogue: 2,1:31:25.49,1:31:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:28.27,1:31:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,下潜了 你说下潜了是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumped? What do you mean, jumped?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:29.39,1:31:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,二战老式潜艇刚刚自己下潜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old World War II sub jumped its moorings.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:31.46,1:31:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定是个变形金刚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in a Transformer.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:43.07,1:31:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能看看嘛 - 不行 我在看呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I get a look? - No, I'm looking.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:44.66,1:31:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你能让开么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you move?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:46.32,1:31:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 别挡路 那是海水吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, get out of the way, man! Is that water?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:48.20,1:31:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大侦探真厉害 - 很明显是海水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No shit, Sherlock. - Obviously, it's water.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:50.74,1:31:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么开吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how to operate it?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:51.52,1:31:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么开的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to operate it, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:52.40,1:31:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你负责开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says you're in charge of this now.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:55.00,1:31:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快让我看看 - 别再碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me see. Let me see. - Don't touch me again!
Dialogue: 2,1:31:57.27,1:31:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别惹我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't freak me out.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:58.16,1:32:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在外星飞船发生的事就留在那里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens in the alien ship stays in the alien ship.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:00.82,1:32:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我要干死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will eff you up!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:04.31,1:32:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥部 我这里探测到潜艇上浮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surface, I have positive surface contact.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:06.54,1:32:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,代码5205{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track number 5205.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:07.94,1:32:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇肯定是要开往远海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sub must be heading for open water,
Dialogue: 2,1:32:09.39,1:32:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,直奔我们的突击小组{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}directly towards our strike group.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:10.48,1:32:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们必须阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we have to cut 'em off. Stop 'em.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:11.98,1:32:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,用尽我们手头的一切资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use whatever assets we have.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:13.33,1:32:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,联系祖鲁舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact the Zulu module.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:14.46,1:32:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有潜艇扼守要道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have all our subs converge on that chokepoint.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:17.13,1:32:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,掌舵手 全体从侧面包抄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helm, all ahead flank.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:20.23,1:32:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,声吶有反应 外星信号 方位150 范围1000码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conn, Sonar. Alien contact, bearing 150, range 1,000 yards.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:23.86,1:32:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,信号方向150{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact bearing 150.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:31.14,1:32:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把海豹突击队送到深潜船上 我们得追他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get SEAL teams in DSVs. We need to chase 'em.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:37.57,1:32:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台 这是一号 准备进港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control. Ace One, going to the bay.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:39.37,1:32:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一号 准备进港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ace One, going to the bay.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:53.44,1:32:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,长老 那样正常吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogman? Is that normal?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:55.15,1:32:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,非常正常 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly normal, ma'am.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:56.45,1:32:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一艘攻击型核潜艇正在我们后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nuclear-class attack submarine is on our stern.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:58.61,1:33:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 快点 跟紧我 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Quick, follow me. Quick.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:01.06,1:33:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的潜艇 不是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your sub, not mine.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:02.64,1:33:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的潜艇 七个小时前 我还只是个大学教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sub? Seven hours ago, I was just a professor.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:10.02,1:33:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 解钩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, uncoupling.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:20.63,1:33:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 动起来 动起来 高速模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's move. Let's move. Put it in high gear.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.36,1:33:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,深潜船2号跟紧我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DSV-2, stay on our tail.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:29.84,1:33:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,声吶 外星信号 一千码 还在靠近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conn, Sonar. Alien contact, 1,000 yards and closing.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:32.65,1:33:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,潜艇上的警报可不是个好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An alarm on a sub is not a good thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:34.30,1:33:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要我们到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did he send us up here?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:35.57,1:33:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我们冲在前面 我们就先死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got us up front so we die first.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:37.21,1:33:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们知道我们在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's let them know we're here.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:38.08,1:33:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,警告射击 一号炮管 一切就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning shot. Make tube one ready in all respects.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:40.29,1:33:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一号炮管发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot tube one.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:50.29,1:33:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,声纳 外星物体 转为垂直方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conn, Sonar. Alien contact going vertical.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:03.04,1:34:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:12.30,1:34:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,声纳 对方掉头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conn, Sonar. It's coming back around.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:13.73,1:34:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要撞击了 - 准备撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's gonna hit us! - Brace for impact!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.26,1:34:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:25.22,1:34:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,声纳 对方要下潜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conn, Sonar. He's going deep!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:27.94,1:34:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在暂时安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're clear for now.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:29.27,1:34:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,放手 你们俩有的是时间和地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands off! There is a time and a place for everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:32.32,1:34:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the time nor the place.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:35.36,1:34:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 现在没空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - Not now!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:36.75,1:34:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 - 离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - Away from here.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.09,1:34:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个小变态把自己当成鱼雷发射出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That little sicko just shot himself out like a torpedo!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:45.30,1:34:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我又不瞎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know! I saw it!
Dialogue: 2,1:34:47.26,1:34:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那些可是你的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are your peoples.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.23,1:34:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好 首相在吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon. Is the Prime Minister in?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:59.87,1:35:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:01.23,1:35:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,首相啊 还能有谁 我有急事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister, who else? It's very urgent.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:03.34,1:35:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,急事啊 你怎么不早说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's urgent, is it? Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.79,1:35:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Dickhead.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:08.23,1:35:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要从老门进 下午好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll use the old entrance. Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:10.95,1:35:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:22.89,1:35:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my... Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:24.03,1:35:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我胳膊上总有这东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got this thing that was on my arm
Dialogue: 2,1:35:25.71,1:35:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而且好像还在乱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's, like, just moving all around.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:27.44,1:35:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 看起来 你要是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It seems to not be... If you'd...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:32.05,1:35:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是感觉有点滑滑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just sort of slithery...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:35.21,1:35:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,从胳膊滑到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slipping from the arm to the...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:36.40,1:35:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 往下滑了 - 往你的裤子里滑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it's coming down. - It's going down your pants there.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:38.61,1:35:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:40.05,1:35:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西紧吗 还是裹在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And is it tight or gripping on?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:42.29,1:35:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不疼 但我不知道它是干啥的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't hurt, but I don't know what it does.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:43.94,1:35:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像个没用的外星垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like some worthless alien junk.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:45.34,1:35:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为它是… 我们会弄清它是干啥的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the purpose... I think the... We'll find out what the purpose is.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:48.58,1:35:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If... If you want to.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:52.90,1:35:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,长老 这都是啥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cogmanl What is... What is all this?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:55.62,1:35:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End of the world.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:56.44,1:35:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得最后的晚餐还是很应景的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought a meal, a last meal, would be in order.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:00.05,1:36:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 我饿坏了 - 别乱来哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great. I'm starving. - No canoodling.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:03.10,1:36:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等会 长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Cogman?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:06.98,1:36:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我女儿会… - 我奶奶说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yep. My daughter would... - So my grandma said...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:08.85,1:36:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我奶奶一定会… - 我女儿一定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My grandma would absolutely... - My daughter would love this.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:10.98,1:36:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她一直说我应该向前看 - 是的 我也想说 她会喜欢的的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She keeps saying I've got to move on. - Yeah, I was about to say. She would love it.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:13.74,1:36:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 是的 一直都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yes, all the time!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:15.22,1:36:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她怎么说的 - "去约会 去找个男朋友"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does she say? - "Go on a date, get a boyfriend."
Dialogue: 2,1:36:17.52,1:36:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这算约会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a date?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:19.48,1:36:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 天啊 这不是约会 这只是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. God, it's not a date. No. It's just that...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:22.19,1:36:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,挺浪漫的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's romantic.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:25.07,1:36:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,长老寿司来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sushi à la Cogman!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:28.12,1:36:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks great.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:36.30,1:36:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sacrifice,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:37.95,1:36:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就没有胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no victory.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:42.99,1:36:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,总统在地堡里了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the President in his bunker?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:45.60,1:36:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:46.99,1:36:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,普京呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about Putin?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:49.13,1:36:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:55.20,1:36:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是新首相吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you the new Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.72,1:36:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,保安 立刻来我办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, my office, now!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:58.75,1:37:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我用的老入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Well, I used the old entrance.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:00.86,1:37:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那个门是用来应急的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That door is used for extraordinary circumstances,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:03.39,1:37:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在的情形就很紧急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and these circumstances are quite extraordinary.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:06.04,1:37:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我长话短说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will keep this very simple.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:08.24,1:37:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty little fellow.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:09.54,1:37:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是让他出来 咱们都会死的很惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let him out, we all die terrible deaths.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:12.45,1:37:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:15.12,1:37:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:16.64,1:37:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是埃德蒙·伯顿爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, my name is Sir Edmond Burton,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:18.37,1:37:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,女皇皇家海军 维基家族团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her Majesty's Royal Navy, Order of the Witwiccans,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:20.85,1:37:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,变形金刚在地球历史的守密者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keeper of the secret history of Transformers here on Earth...
Dialogue: 2,1:37:23.89,1:37:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 维基家族团 - 维基家族团 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Witwiccans? - Witwiccans, yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:27.87,1:37:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但它们都灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they all died out.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:30.13,1:37:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是灭绝了 目前还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all of them. Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:33.43,1:37:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但我需要你调动你所有的资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do need you to marshal all your resources...
Dialogue: 2,1:37:36.17,1:37:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等会 你才… - 你最好闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. You have just... - Best shut up.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:37.47,1:37:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从墙里出来 现在就 - 听我说完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emerged from the wall and now... - Let me finish. Let me...
Dialogue: 2,1:37:39.37,1:37:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 2,1:37:44.30,1:37:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:48.11,1:37:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就像我说的那样 我需要你调用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. As I said, I need you to marshal
Dialogue: 2,1:37:50.00,1:37:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所有资源 所有军事资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all your resources, all your military assets.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:52.80,1:37:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你也大概想到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because as you no doubt have surmised,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:55.23,1:37:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,世界要毁灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world is going to end,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:57.07,1:37:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而我知道何时何地会毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I know where. And when.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:06.39,1:38:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是自中世纪以来第一个见到这艘船的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the first to see this ship since the Dark Ages.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:10.32,1:38:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的护身符是解开这艘船的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your talisman is the key to unlocking this ship.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:28.64,1:38:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,声吶显示 大概还有800米{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonar has about 800 meters.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:33.12,1:38:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得四点钟方向有敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got a bogey at four o'clock.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:35.76,1:38:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我渐渐能看清楚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're starting to see it through the murk.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:39.74,1:38:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,下面有灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's lights down here.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:43.04,1:38:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 快看 是艘大外星飞船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Look at that. It's a big alien ship.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:46.33,1:38:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,总部 你们看到了吗 真大啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Topside, are you catching this? It's massive.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:55.55,1:38:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船知道我们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship knows we're here.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:12.97,1:39:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on his tail.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:19.21,1:39:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:25.17,1:39:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,门封上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door just sealed.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.77,1:39:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,试试那些管道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try those tubes.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:30.45,1:39:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,二号深潜船 跟紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DSV-2, stay close. Stay close.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.06,1:39:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,总部 我们要进去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Topside, we're going in.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:35.17,1:39:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,无线电通信将会断开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna lose radio contact.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:47.86,1:39:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们进急流了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in a current!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:49.28,1:39:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 稳住 稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady, steady, steady!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:50.68,1:39:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用机械臂保持…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the arms to keep us...
Dialogue: 2,1:39:55.74,1:39:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来控制 - 离墙远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep control! - Stay off the wall!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:56.84,1:39:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坚持住 - 离墙远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold it! - Stay off the wall!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:20.60,1:40:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What now?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:21.71,1:40:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最后的骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the last knight.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:22.93,1:40:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是厄尔的特殊人选 你自己想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Earl's special guy. You figure it out.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:28.81,1:40:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:30.13,1:40:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要下水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going in that water.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:31.63,1:40:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的齿轮会卡在主轴上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gears would be sucked into my main shaft.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:38.40,1:40:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你俩都在我的黑名单上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're both on my shit list.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:06.93,1:41:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遇到了盲点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were blinded.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:08.90,1:41:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被太阳遮住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blinded by the sun.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:11.14,1:41:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它把自己的踪迹藏在太阳背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The planet hid its approach behind our star.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:13.90,1:41:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去好像是故意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to be acting deliberately.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:41.18,1:41:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,多次撞击正在形成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozens of strikes currently modeled.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:44.29,1:41:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔法站将会承受第一次撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First impact will be Alpha Station.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:47.30,1:41:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没有救生舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no escape pod.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:49.30,1:41:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,两个小时后 地球也要遭殃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth will follow two hours later.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:51.49,1:41:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,多米尼克估计会有千万人伤亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic modeled potential casualties in the tens of millions.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:57.15,1:41:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了两个月亮 两个月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two moons! There's two moons!
Dialogue: 2,1:42:00.47,1:42:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就要毁灭了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world is ending?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:03.08,1:42:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有人说这将会是全球性灾难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some are saying that it's going to be a global killer.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:04.81,1:42:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所知的人类文明会在十二小时后改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human civilization as we know it will change in 12 hours.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:08.33,1:42:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,据专家说 破坏将是巨大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The destruction, we're told by experts, will be immense.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:28.12,1:42:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:29.30,1:42:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:30.64,1:42:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,老头想让我们干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does the old man want us to do?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:40.09,1:42:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 绕开 找条别的路 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, go around, find another way! Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:42:41.73,1:42:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你在搞笑吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:42.87,1:42:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我想困在这种地方吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think I like winding up in a place like this?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:51.43,1:42:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,它想让我们往这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wants us to go this way.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:56.25,1:42:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,交易员 那帮孙子确实带着我们的飞船回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daytrader! Son of a bitch actually came through with our ship!
Dialogue: 2,1:42:59.01,1:43:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 我们要去英国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. We are going to England.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:01.63,1:43:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,事情越来越复杂了 确实很乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are likely to get nasty. Real nasty.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:04.04,1:43:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我能跟你们去吗 他也许需要我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, can I come? He might need me.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:06.52,1:43:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小公主 当然 我不是你地球上的父母 快登船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little lady, hell, I ain't no Earth parent. Hop aboard.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:10.28,1:43:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,来一场去前线的旅行吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a field trip to the front lines.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:12.27,1:43:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们弄点动静出来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go make some noise.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:13.63,1:43:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,弄死他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give 'em hell.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.60,1:43:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我浑身充满干劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm driving.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:17.98,1:43:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 凯德 我虽然不太想承认这事 但是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cade, I'm reluctant to say this to you, but
Dialogue: 2,1:43:20.86,1:43:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你真是 太勇敢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that you're quite, you know, brave.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:23.99,1:43:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在夸我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a compliment?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:26.14,1:43:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你也可以回夸我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could throw one back my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:28.07,1:43:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 待我组织一下语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's got to happen organically.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:31.00,1:43:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是第一个进入潜艇的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the first off the sub.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:39.32,1:43:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Hold.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:41.94,1:43:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得就是这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's here!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:17.34,1:44:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a tomb.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:20.40,1:44:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,空间站 这里是休斯顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Station, Houston.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:21.52,1:44:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,安全区域配置程序第五页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Page five of the safe zone config procedure.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:25.20,1:44:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把推进器设置为自动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take thrusters to auto.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:29.16,1:44:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's happening-
Dialogue: 2,1:44:31.24,1:44:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就在我们的大气层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in our atmosphere now.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:33.04,1:44:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,国际空间站就是第一个目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ISS is our first hit.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:34.89,1:44:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,推进器集合管都不好使了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Progress manifolds both failed.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:36.77,1:44:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有推进器能用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thrusters available.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:39.40,1:44:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要接近你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conjunction is imminent.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:41.82,1:44:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运 上帝保佑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck and Godspeed.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:53.53,1:44:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,行动 行动 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move in, move in, check up.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:03.59,1:45:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是种仪式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formality.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:05.91,1:45:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士总是在保护什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knights are always guarding something.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:11.31,1:45:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on. Look at this.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:13.09,1:45:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是凯尔特图案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Celtic.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:35.06,1:45:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是梅林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Merlin.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:37.48,1:45:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,传说是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's real.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:39.04,1:45:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of it!
Dialogue: 2,1:45:40.93,1:45:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看上面的文字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what does this say?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:44.85,1:45:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是 没有人应该拥有它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means, "No one shall have it."
Dialogue: 2,1:45:47.03,1:45:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我们费了这么大劲下来这里 看到所有这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. We came all the way down here, all this,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:50.80,1:45:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不打算打开吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're not gonna open it?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:53.28,1:45:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然是要打开的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I'm going to open it.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:54.75,1:45:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们动手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:57.34,1:45:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? Let's do this.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:12.43,1:46:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是在逗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:17.29,1:46:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们费劲来到这就为了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've come all this way for this?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:19.74,1:46:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,为了看你曾曾曾祖父的破骨头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your ugly great-great granddad's bones
Dialogue: 2,1:46:21.52,1:46:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,被装在一个盒子里还有什么破棍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a box and some stupid stick?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:23.84,1:46:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是在逗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:24.76,1:46:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就用这破棍怎么拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna save the world with this?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:26.63,1:46:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我在家门前砍一截橡树就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've cut an oak tree down at my house and...
Dialogue: 2,1:46:29.67,1:46:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你能闭嘴么 行不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say a word. Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:31.18,1:46:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你那浪漫的口音现在对我没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The smooth little romantic accent's not gonna work right now.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:34.74,1:46:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没话说 - 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm speechless. - Thank God.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:36.97,1:46:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有人偷了法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe someone stole it?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:38.28,1:46:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 一定有别的什么东西 应该在这里的某处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there's something else. It's got to be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:41.97,1:46:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不能空手而归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't come all this way for nothing.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:44.35,1:46:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,整个世界处于危险之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole world's at stake.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:54.20,1:46:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 仪器出问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, the meters are freaking.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:57.48,1:47:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿都能检测出热源 这些东西 它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got thermals everywhere. These things, they...
Dialogue: 2,1:47:01.49,1:47:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是还活着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could still be alive.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:05.16,1:47:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个家伙什么情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:15.51,1:47:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁为梅林的法杖而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has come for the staff?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:19.94,1:47:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击它 攻击它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him! Shoot him!
Dialogue: 2,1:47:25.55,1:47:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! - Get out!
Dialogue: 2,1:47:31.06,1:47:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我来引开它 你快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to distract him. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:35.51,1:47:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 法杖在我手上 - 快打它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have the staff! - Hit it!
Dialogue: 2,1:47:46.07,1:47:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,保护法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect the staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:53.76,1:47:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把它的眼睛干掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take his eyes out!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:27.09,1:48:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,脚下这东西正在动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's moving.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:29.61,1:48:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,包围她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corner her!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:30.98,1:48:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:32.29,1:48:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,把武器放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the weapon.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:36.04,1:48:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:40.37,1:48:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你放下枪 否则我扔下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drop it, or I will.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:45.18,1:48:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你在干什么 伦诺克斯 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're doing, Lennox. Stop!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:46.57,1:48:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的就是这个武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is that weapon!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:47.63,1:48:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来啊 打我啊 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go ahead, shoot me! - No!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:49.78,1:48:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我能操纵它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only I can wield it.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:51.76,1:48:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:53.84,1:48:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:55.65,1:48:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,打我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot me!
Dialogue: 2,1:48:57.44,1:48:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你现在在做什么 伦诺克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're doing, Lennox.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:00.59,1:49:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别出手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:03.49,1:49:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,保护法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect the staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:22.80,1:49:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是来找法杖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come for that staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:32.32,1:49:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你干啥呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:35.19,1:49:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把法杖给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:36.80,1:49:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 凯德 我们并肩战斗过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Cade. We fought together.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:39.09,1:49:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我为我自己种族战斗 我自己的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fight for my own kind! My own planet!
Dialogue: 2,1:49:44.20,1:49:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯德 - 这不是你 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cade? - This isn't you, Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:45.92,1:49:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把法杖给我 人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the staff, human.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:49.03,1:49:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:50.90,1:49:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:52.98,1:49:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,把法杖给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to him.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:00.20,1:50:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:14.99,1:50:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我看谁还敢挑战我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who dares to challenge me?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:26.25,1:50:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都不对劲 大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all wrong, Bee.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:27.42,1:50:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了一些事 那不是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something happened. That is not Optimus.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:29.11,1:50:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你得找到他 大黄蜂 记得ZB-7模式吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to find him, Bee. Remember ZB-7?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:31.54,1:50:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你得变回那种模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to be that Autobot again.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:33.56,1:50:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你得回到潜艇里 行么 离开这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look you got to get back to the sub, all right? Get out of here.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:35.85,1:50:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what about you?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:36.86,1:50:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂能保护我 该我上场了 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee's always had my back. It's my turn to have his. Go.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:39.31,1:50:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快回到潜艇里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get back to the DSV.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:40.83,1:50:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,让上面的人知道我们弄丢了法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them know up top that we lost control of the weapon.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:43.29,1:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:44.96,1:50:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到他说的了 快回到潜艇里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him. Back to the sub!
Dialogue: 2,1:50:46.73,1:50:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna find him.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:42.36,1:51:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 我们要往高处走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we got to get to the top!
Dialogue: 2,1:51:46.64,1:51:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:50.40,1:51:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能做到 快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make it! Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:06.73,1:52:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 巨浪来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, big wave coming!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:27.35,1:52:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是复仇至尊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Nemesis Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:31.26,1:52:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are nothing!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:39.55,1:52:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:41.64,1:52:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机会落在14到16区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air's gonna be on station 14 to 16.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:43.68,1:52:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,技术中心 看起来像是有个外星飞船上浮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TOC, it looks like we have a surfaced alien ship.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.62,1:52:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电4号看到了擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lightning 4 has visual on Optimus.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:54.54,1:52:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 擎天柱 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime! Prime, stop!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:56.65,1:52:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 请你停下来 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime, you got to stop! Please! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:00.18,1:53:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:01.68,1:53:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 那是大黄蜂啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? It's Bee!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:04.01,1:53:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime! You can't do this.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:50.95,1:53:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:53.80,1:53:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,停 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:56.92,1:54:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是大黄蜂 你认识最久的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Bumblebee, your oldest friend.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:01.22,1:54:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus,
Dialogue: 2,1:54:03.32,1:54:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意为你献出生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would lay down my life for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:14.62,1:54:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 你的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee. Your voice.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:18.34,1:54:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,自从塞伯坦星球毁灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not heard it
Dialogue: 2,1:54:20.35,1:54:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我就再没听过你的声音了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since Cybertron fell.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:36.49,1:54:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I done?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:50.44,1:54:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你错失了杀死宇宙大帝的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew your chance to kill Unicron.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:54.19,1:54:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你做不成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:57.17,1:54:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你时日无多了 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your time is over, Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:00.34,1:55:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You failed.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:02.47,1:55:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛了塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turned your back on Cybertron.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:06.51,1:55:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你就看着地球毁灭吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you will watch Earth die.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:11.44,1:55:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:19.05,1:55:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不怎么好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not going so well.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:32.38,1:55:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:38.76,1:55:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛了你的种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed your own kind.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:41.66,1:55:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 擎天柱 起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Prime, get up!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:43.32,1:55:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你选择了错误的队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chose the wrong side.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:46.01,1:55:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,守卫骑士要杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Guardian Knights are going to kill me.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:50.78,1:55:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,昆塔莎是最大的骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quintessa is the great deceiver!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:00.69,1:56:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对你的审判就是死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The judgment is death.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:58.24,1:57:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 我辜负了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, I have failed you.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:04.10,1:57:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我毁了地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have doomed Earth.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:07.77,1:57:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,地球 宇宙中唯一一个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth, the only place in the universe
Dialogue: 2,1:57:12.10,1:57:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我称之为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose people let me call it
Dialogue: 2,1:57:16.36,1:57:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}home.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:22.13,1:57:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你才能弥补过失 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you can make it right, Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:25.76,1:57:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你我不能成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:28.61,1:57:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有一次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment, that's all we got.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:31.79,1:57:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,取决于你 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up to you, Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:33.77,1:57:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没有你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because without you,
Dialogue: 2,1:57:35.86,1:57:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we all die.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:40.20,1:57:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,机不可失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's now or never.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:42.80,1:57:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的兄弟们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers,
Dialogue: 2,1:57:44.72,1:57:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会再背叛你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never betray you again.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:49.57,1:57:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:52.39,1:57:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要拯救地球 我们得去塞伯坦星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save Earth, we must go to Cybertron
Dialogue: 2,1:57:56.67,1:57:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死昆塔莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destroy Quintessa.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:22.48,1:58:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship is coming.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:24.64,1:58:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,景色真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is beautiful.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:38.43,1:58:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱给了我们最后阶段的坐标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime gave us the coordinates for the endgame.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:40.71,1:58:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an ignition chamber.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:42.08,1:58:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,武器就在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The weapon's going up there.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:43.48,1:58:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,让掠夺者和卫星启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Preds and satellites eyes on.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:45.51,1:58:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,找到那个地方 准备好参战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find it and prepare to engage.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:49.70,1:58:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,独眼兽 21000英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cyclops, 21,000 feet.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:50.90,1:58:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,定位目标 点火室 我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyeball target, ignition chamber. We found it.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:53.08,1:58:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱的坐标很准确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime's coordinates are good.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:54.55,1:58:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,连接点火室 目标在视野中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact, ignition chamber. Target in sight.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:58.09,1:58:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,点火室 点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignition chamber, ignition chamber.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:59.80,1:59:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得搞明白是怎么个原理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to figure out what makes it tick.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:02.12,1:59:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得关了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to shut it down!
Dialogue: 2,1:59:04.58,1:59:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:59:07.24,1:59:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你很高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:08.73,1:59:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here! Let's go!
Dialogue: 2,1:59:13.48,1:59:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 我们准备要高空跳伞到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, we're gonna prep a HALO jump
Dialogue: 2,1:59:15.07,1:59:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那个点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on that ignition chamber.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:16.66,1:59:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在那些藤蔓中飞机定位不准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Planes will never nav through those vines.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:18.59,1:59:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伦诺克斯 相信我 我们的飞船就在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lennox, trust me. That's our ride right there.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:21.92,1:59:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用汽车人的飞船 把鱼鹰直升机装进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Autobot ship. Put the Ospreys in that.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:24.35,1:59:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以送我们上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll get us up there.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:25.92,1:59:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人的飞船会载着鱼鹰直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobot ship's gonna drop the Ospreys.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:27.69,1:59:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,滑翔至登陆区 风险很大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll virtually glide to the LZ. It's gonna be high-risk.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:30.04,1:59:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在20000英尺要干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to do what at 20,000 feet?
Dialogue: 2,1:59:32.73,1:59:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 有个小姑娘 一位女士 事实上是一名老师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, there's this girl. Woman, actually. Teacher.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:35.00,1:59:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 牛津大学的 - 还会打一点马球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oxford. - She plays a little polo.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:38.00,1:59:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太有意思了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's fantastic.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:40.28,1:59:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会帮她进到点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna break her into the chamber
Dialogue: 2,1:59:41.99,1:59:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把法杖偷出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to steal the staff.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:43.34,1:59:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这可能是你出的最馊的主意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that is the dumbest idea you could possibly have!
Dialogue: 2,1:59:47.12,1:59:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,个人来说 我依靠物理和数学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I 'm gonna rely on physics and mathematics
Dialogue: 2,1:59:49.69,1:59:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来拯救星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save the planet,
Dialogue: 2,1:59:50.48,1:59:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是什么神秘主义 童话故事 还有什么妖魔鬼怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not mysticism, fairies, and some hobgoblins.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:10.60,2:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我一生就是为了这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived for this.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:12.28,2:00:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我生来就是要毁灭星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived to kill a planet!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:15.78,2:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,为了我们的星球 我激活这个入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For our world, I activate this portal!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:35.70,2:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:59.21,2:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,尔等可怜的人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wretched human!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:20.68,2:01:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:26.41,2:01:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:29.40,2:01:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你收到了我的信息 你把所有人都带来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got my message. You brought everyone here.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:31.54,2:01:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:34.95,2:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:36.46,2:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just found Optimus Prime!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:39.71,2:01:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他会解决这堆烂事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna deal with all this shit!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:42.32,2:01:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他会救我们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna save our asses!
Dialogue: 2,2:01:45.43,2:01:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了一队人马 兄弟 我带人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought the troops, man. I brought the troops.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:48.76,2:01:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,骑士们 汽车人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knights, Autobots,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:51.00,2:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,结局绝对不会是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this cannot and will not be the end.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:56.35,2:01:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为了拯救地球和她的人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save Earth and her people,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:59.28,2:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要偷昆塔莎的法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are going to steal Quintessa's staff.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:03.08,2:02:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你 薇薇安 能拿回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you, Viviane, can take it back.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:07.90,2:02:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我会护送她进入点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will lead the way into her chamber.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:11.85,2:02:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,当光辉岁月铭刻在星云之上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the account of the ages is etched into the cosmos,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:16.82,2:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,后人将会知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let those who exist long after us know
Dialogue: 2,2:02:21.01,2:02:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们最荣耀的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this was our finest hour.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:30.46,2:02:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我太爱这个人了 每次都鸡皮疙瘩掉满地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love that guy. Goosebumps every time.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:33.48,2:02:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没跟他说你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got to say hi.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:37.85,2:02:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:39.56,2:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉着这些人够吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think there's enough?
Dialogue: 2,2:02:41.27,2:02:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不 远远不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not even close.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:45.13,2:02:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人 福尔杰主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord! Lord Folgan!
Dialogue: 2,2:02:57.12,2:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了 长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it, Cogman.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:00.79,2:03:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我完成了我的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had my moment.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:04.28,2:03:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did, my lord.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:07.62,2:03:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我工作中最艰难的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the hardest part of my job.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:10.28,2:03:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看着福尔杰家族的人死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching Folgans die.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:13.81,2:03:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Cogman.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:16.29,2:03:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,继续辅佐家族吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carry on.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:22.28,2:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我服务过的所有的伯爵中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the earls I have had the pleasure to serve,
Dialogue: 2,2:03:26.23,2:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到现在为止你是最酷的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were by far the coolest.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:41.44,2:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我探测到法杖的能量了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have found your staff of power.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:45.26,2:03:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人能伤害我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only one who can hurt us.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:47.93,2:03:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我感受到了 她不能进来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt her. She must not enter.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:51.23,2:03:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的军队会阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My army will stop them.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:54.55,2:03:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我们的星球恢复 他们的星球毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch as our world heals and theirs dies.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:59.95,2:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一个世界重生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world reborn!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:27.80,2:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:44.01,2:04:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这些碎片会砸死我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna crush us.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:45.59,2:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,现在赶紧上飞船 离开挤压区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that ship clear of the crush zone now!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:47.50,2:04:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得离开这里 - 快到鱼鹰直升机上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got to bail! - Move to the Ospreys!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:59.32,2:05:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走 快到直升机上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move, move! To the Ospreys!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:01.64,2:05:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西就在我们上面移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing's gonna roll right over us!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:12.56,2:05:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:25.37,2:05:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,最初的部分要开始移动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preliminary numbers are starting to come in.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:28.16,2:05:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,抹去城市 数百万人会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally scraping away cities. Millions will die.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:46.02,2:05:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,它在用地球的地热能源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's using Earth's geothermal energy
Dialogue: 2,2:05:47.84,2:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来重构和重建它自己 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reconstitute, to rebuild itself, all right?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:49.84,2:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们的地核冷却了 就像现在这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our core cools, which is rapidly cooling right now,
Dialogue: 2,2:05:53.32,2:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,地球的磁场就会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the magnetic field dissolves, exposing us
Dialogue: 2,2:05:55.20,2:05:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将暴露在大剂量的宇宙辐射里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to high levels of cosmic radiation.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:58.50,2:05:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你们会理解这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you'll understand this.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:00.31,2:06:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,地球会变成一台微波炉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth becomes a microwave.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:01.96,2:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是爆米花 爆米花胀袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the popcorn. Jiffy Pop bag goes
Dialogue: 2,2:06:04.76,2:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,砰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}boom.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:06.56,2:06:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就烧焦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fry.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:21.79,2:06:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,面相看着不善呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very mean-looking.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:23.85,2:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那些家伙不过是胆小鬼罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look like wusses to me.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:26.60,2:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他们不堪一击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they all messed up.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:29.38,2:06:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有两分钟 两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes! Hey, two minutes!
Dialogue: 2,2:06:32.15,2:06:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个能干掉霸天虎吗 - 不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That thing kill Decepticons? - No.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:34.87,2:06:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:38.42,2:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真的"有一群勇士愿意牺牲一切"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A few brave warriors willing to sacrifice all."
Dialogue: 2,2:06:42.76,2:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还告诉我的学生那些都是胡扯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told my students that was bullshit.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:45.19,2:06:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,出发了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load out, let's go!
Dialogue: 2,2:06:48.64,2:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你明天打算干嘛 - 你现在就问我这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing tomorrow? - Are you asking me that now?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:51.26,2:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:52.82,2:06:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没计划吗 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No plans? Good.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:56.00,2:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快上飞机吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the plane.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:57.96,2:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们出发 走吧 - 都动作快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go, let's go! - Let's step it up!
Dialogue: 2,2:06:59.84,2:07:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,系好了 这一趟会很颠簸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strap in. It's gonna be a rough ride.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:01.84,2:07:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 系紧点儿 - 我会帮你扣好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tighter. - I'm gonna hook you up.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:03.85,2:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,下拉到底 对吧 就这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it down tight, right? Just this one?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:05.57,2:07:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你跳出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You jump...
Dialogue: 2,2:07:06.56,2:07:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后拉这个 对吗 - 这个是我该拉的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then pull this, right? - This is the one I pull, right?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:08.26,2:07:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拉这个 光拉就行 玩命拉就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull? Just pull it? You just pull it as hard as you can?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:11.28,2:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:12.90,2:07:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,能借用你的手机吗 我给女儿发条短信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I borrow your cell phone? I've got to text my daughter.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:15.53,2:07:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:24.82,2:07:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:26.14,2:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:38.39,2:07:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,已看到目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target in sight.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:41.32,2:07:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,接近 点火室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact, ignition chamber.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:42.72,2:07:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击小队 行动 行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strike package. Execute. Execute.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:44.25,2:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,开战 开战 开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight's on, fight's on, fight's on.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:56.44,2:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不明物接近 不明物接近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bogeys inbound. Bogeys inbound.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:58.61,2:08:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 上飞船吧 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, get to your ship. Good luck.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:01.80,2:08:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,三十秒后跳伞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds to drop!
Dialogue: 2,2:08:03.88,2:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿着陆的时候能容易点儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those birds better be softening our target.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:05.84,2:08:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你这让我怎么能放心呀 伦诺克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not giving me that warm, fuzzy feeling, Lennox.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:07.68,2:08:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼鹰飞行限高一万两千英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Osprey's flight ceiling is 12,000 feet.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:09.79,2:08:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经翻倍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're double that.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:11.01,2:08:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,空气太稀薄 螺旋桨吃不住力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air's too thin, the rotor's got no grab.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:13.10,2:08:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得硬着陆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be coming in hard.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:14.92,2:08:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 全是坏消息 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all bad news. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:19.72,2:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没事儿吧 伊格尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All good, Yeager?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:21.36,2:08:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么要说的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got something to say?
