Dialogue: 2,2:08:29.24,2:08:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我信仰的可是一个伟人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believed in one of the great ones.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:30.85,2:08:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他是擎天柱 还有他的队伍 我一直都很相信他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime. And his crew. I never lost faith.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:34.12,2:08:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不信他 全世界都不信他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did. The whole world did.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:36.59,2:08:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们又想和我一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you want to fly with me.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:40.24,2:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我很感谢你们安排此行 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I appreciate you guys making the trip. Thank you.
