Dialogue: 2,2:08:59.82,2:09:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,伦诺克斯 你的队伍待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lennox, your team is to hold.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:01.84,2:09:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗机在各个方向都损失惨重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strike fighters are getting shot down.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:03.89,2:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不 必须要趁现在 飞行员 现在跳 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's now or never. Pilots, go now! Go!
Dialogue: 2,2:09:07.25,2:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang Qn!
Dialogue: 2,2:09:08.99,2:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娃娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chihuahua.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:10.36,2:09:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这里干什么 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here? - I don't know.
