Dialogue: 2,2:09:42.16,2:09:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉娃娃 - 会没事的 会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chihuahua. - It's okay. It's okay.
