Dialogue: 2,2:10:05.37,2:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,控制台 分散队形 分散队形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, spread it out, spread it out.
