Dialogue: 2,2:15:23.88,2:15:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们不能放弃擎天柱 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! We're not giving up on Prime, okay?
Dialogue: 2,2:15:25.79,2:15:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他会来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna be here!
Dialogue: 2,2:15:26.59,2:15:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们刚刚改了整个计划 我们进不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just changed the whole plan. We can't get inside.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:28.92,2:15:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我们的行动结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - The operation is over.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:31.22,2:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再待着 就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stay, we're dead.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:32.61,2:15:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须进那儿去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get in there!
Dialogue: 2,2:15:33.56,2:15:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人拿好降落伞 我们要撤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, grab your chutes, we're bailing!
Dialogue: 2,2:15:39.36,2:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:48.17,2:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,开火 开火 开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight, fight, fight.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:49.20,2:15:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight's on.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:56.44,2:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 小朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job, little friend.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:58.56,2:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 激光瞄准目标 - 快 快 快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Laze the target! - Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 2,2:16:02.31,2:16:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move!
Dialogue: 2,2:16:03.11,2:16:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快撤 我们掩护 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move out! We got you covered! Move!
Dialogue: 2,2:16:11.06,2:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus.
Dialogue: 2,2:16:15.27,2:16:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 2,2:16:35.08,2:16:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你个丑八怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ugly mess!
Dialogue: 2,2:16:40.86,2:16:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是忘了 我是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you forget who I am?
Dialogue: 2,2:16:54.54,2:16:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 2,2:16:57.84,2:17:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, attack!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:09.22,2:17:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,激光瞄准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laze the target!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:10.93,2:17:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄它 瞄它 瞄它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laze it, laze it, laze it.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:13.24,2:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,确认激光标记 确认目标上的激光印记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laser paint confirmed. Laser paint confirmed on target.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:15.40,2:17:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:16.09,2:17:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,银箭导弹 发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silver arrows, fire.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:18.73,2:17:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹已发射 导弹已发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missiles away, missiles away.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:20.14,2:17:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:22.28,2:17:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:25.15,2:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 我们走 - 我觉得我做不到啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, let's go - I don't think I can do this.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:29.00,2:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有九秒钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine seconds.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:30.26,2:17:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要回家了 伊莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going home, Izzy.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:33.61,2:17:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 别扔下我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mademoiselle, don't go!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:35.92,2:17:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,薇薇安在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Viviane?
Dialogue: 2,2:17:37.48,2:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了 老大 他们全都开溜了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone, boss. They're all chickening out.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:40.11,2:17:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你错了呢 伦诺克斯 要是不管用呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you're wrong, Lennox? What if it doesn't work?
Dialogue: 2,2:17:41.98,2:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,会管用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna work!
Dialogue: 2,2:17:43.73,2:17:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们一起跳 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we're doing this together, okay?
Dialogue: 2,2:17:45.54,2:17:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 拜托了 击中 击中吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here we go. - Hit it, hit it, hit it...
Dialogue: 2,2:17:56.19,2:17:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了 我们撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go! We're bailing.
Dialogue: 2,2:17:59.52,2:18:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 为了那些脏兮兮的旧书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - It's just dusty old books.
Dialogue: 2,2:18:01.88,2:18:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 2,2:18:05.53,2:18:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:06.79,2:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她这是开什么玩笑呢 糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got to be kidding me. Shit!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:24.89,2:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,薇薇安 进这里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viviane! Get in here!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:27.00,2:18:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我的好姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! My little lady.
Dialogue: 2,2:18:43.81,2:18:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:48.78,2:18:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade!
Dialogue: 2,2:18:58.17,2:19:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥部 请注意 点火室正在坍塌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Command, be advised, ignition chamber is tumbling.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:01.11,2:19:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 点火室已经支离破碎 即将倒塌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, chamber is broke loose. It is falling.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:12.95,2:19:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,能量传送还在进行中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The energy transfer is still continuing.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:15.52,2:19:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,倒计时 还有55分钟就会撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T-minus 55 minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:17.68,2:19:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这竟然没有起作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it didn't work.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:19.26,2:19:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 我在降落过程中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, I'm in my chute.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:20.41,2:19:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还能看到能量在传送{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chamber is still arcing power.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:22.13,2:19:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看来没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it worked.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:24.12,2:19:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Hold on!
Dialogue: 2,2:19:42.74,2:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我 我来带路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. I'm gonna lead the way.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:49.64,2:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 就在那了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, there it is.
Dialogue: 2,2:19:50.70,2:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,薇薇安 去拿法杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the staff, Viviane!
Dialogue: 2,2:19:53.40,2:19:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, go!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:07.54,2:20:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, watch out!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:12.88,2:20:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,时间停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the time!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:14.82,2:20:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要爆了你的头 威震天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna blow your head off, Megatron!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:16.96,2:20:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sayonara, bubblehead!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:35.75,2:20:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,威震天 杀掉她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Megatron, kill her!
Dialogue: 2,2:20:50.76,2:20:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾经是兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were brothers once.
Dialogue: 2,2:20:53.29,2:20:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once.
Dialogue: 2,2:21:21.58,2:21:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要失重了 失重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going weightless. Weightless!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:29.04,2:21:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住我的手 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grab my hand. - Yes!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:40.53,2:21:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let it go!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:47.55,2:21:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,昆塔莎 滚出我们的星球去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quintessa, get off our planet!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:51.68,2:21:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你个叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You traitor!
Dialogue: 2,2:21:56.64,2:21:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我的朋友打个招呼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hello to my friend,
Dialogue: 2,2:21:59.52,2:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee.
Dialogue: 2,2:22:07.45,2:22:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,致命如蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sting like a bee.
Dialogue: 2,2:22:27.51,2:22:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I save you!
Dialogue: 2,2:22:35.19,2:22:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我来停住时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stop the time.
Dialogue: 2,2:23:44.94,2:23:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这算明天了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it tomorrow yet?
Dialogue: 2,2:23:51.53,2:23:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在每一个传说中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the heart of every legend,
Dialogue: 2,2:23:54.57,2:23:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都蕴含着真理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is truth.
Dialogue: 2,2:23:58.04,2:24:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一群勇敢的灵魂团结起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few brave souls unite
Dialogue: 2,2:24:01.54,2:24:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救他们的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save their worlds.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:04.51,2:24:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能成为自己生命里的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can be heroes in our own lives,
Dialogue: 2,2:24:08.78,2:24:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every one of us,
Dialogue: 2,2:24:10.44,2:24:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们有勇气去尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we only have the courage to try.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:15.24,2:24:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved Prime.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:18.64,2:24:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的命运总是彼此交缠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our fates were always intertwined.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:22.27,2:24:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但这一刻 我们的世界合二为一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now our worlds are joined as one.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:27.62,2:24:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要重建我们的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to repair our planets.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:30.71,2:24:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们要生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work together...
Dialogue: 2,2:24:32.44,2:24:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就必须齐心协力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we wish to survive.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:36.04,2:24:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,疯狂的一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy family, huh?
Dialogue: 2,2:24:39.94,2:24:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你干得不错 伙计 真心不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did good, bro. Real good.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:44.98,2:24:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,地球的深处还藏着一个危险的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dangerous secret is buried deep inside the Earth.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:50.26,2:24:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个星球上还有许多未知的事物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is more to this planet than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:55.45,2:24:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime,
Dialogue: 2,2:24:58.53,2:25:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有的汽车人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calling all Autobots.
Dialogue: 2,2:25:02.00,2:25:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time
Dialogue: 2,2:25:04.55,2:25:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come home.
Dialogue: 2,2:25:57.13,2:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you lost?
Dialogue: 2,2:26:01.71,2:26:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的话 就不会那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:04.32,2:26:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不要碰他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch him.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:07.24,2:26:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他不喜欢那样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't like it.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:09.68,2:26:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who doesn't like what?
Dialogue: 2,2:26:12.74,2:26:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙大帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unicron.
Dialogue: 2,2:26:15.38,2:26:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我可以向你展示怎么杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I could show you how to kill him.
